ble time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-08T07:00:49.407Z"],["3794257","LSS-59847","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Wojciech Bodal,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-08T07:00:50.511Z"],["3794258","PFI-805642","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Olaf Liszkowski,\n\nWe haven't heard from you in 5 days. If there's no response in the next 24 hours, we'll go ahead and close this ticket.\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-08T07:00:53.154Z"],["3794260","LSS-58872","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Liisa Puu,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-08T07:01:33.582Z"],["3794261","LSS-59102","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Dawit Villarzu,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-08T07:01:33.820Z"],["3794262","LSS-59165","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Alon Alkalay,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-08T07:01:34.985Z"],["3794263","LSS-60002","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Dawit Villarzu,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-08T07:01:35.293Z"],["3794264","LSS-59743","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Ieva Fowler,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-08T07:01:35.787Z"],["3794265","PFI-830822","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-08T07:02:27.361Z"],["3794266","MVRT-1443","MVRT","evamaria.ots@bolt.eu","Eva Maria Ots","[~accountid:629de86ec97b1b00687a22cd] There is no blog post in ENG yet, it will go up after the Spanish launch in PR ","2026-01-08T07:02:41.091Z"],["3794269","LSS-57542","LSS","federico.michelini@bolt.eu","Federico Michelini","Thanks [~accountid:712020:02e8ad5d-a35d-44b9-b445-6111cdb230dc] , replied in the comments now - we can proceed with signatures","2026-01-08T07:04:09.200Z"],["3794270","PFI-822079","PFI","elena-roxana.iordachel@bolt.eu","Elena-Roxana Iordăchel","Hello!\nHere are the fleet’s last payouts that are stuck in Pending/ Exported:\n\n\n* [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/230626991|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/230626991]\n* [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/231590260|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/231590260]\n* [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/230626991|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/230626991]\n\n","2026-01-08T07:05:44.720Z"],["3794271","PFI-830389","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-08T07:06:35.366Z"],["3794272","PFI-830439","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-08T07:06:38.737Z"],["3794273","PFI-830448","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-08T07:06:41.714Z"],["3794274","PFI-830507","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-08T07:06:44.723Z"],["3794275","PFI-830590","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-08T07:06:47.499Z"],["3794279","DRAG101-448","DRAG101","erki.saarik@bolt.eu","Erki Saarik","During the vibration test the bracket got broken - upper and lower fixation clips got broken but controller did not jump out from the bracket.\n\n!image-20260108-070730.png|width=591,alt=\"image-20260108-070730.png\"!\n\nNeed to find a way how to improve:\n\n* different plastic alloy\n* extra ribs\n* thicker material\n* metal bracket","2026-01-08T07:08:33.433Z"],["3794283","PFI-830796","PFI","tasneem.ngophaiwan@bolt.eu","Tasneem Ngophaiwan","Hi [~accountid:712020:fc931233-46f4-49ba-9c3f-702b42bba3d3] \n\nIf you have the email from Citibank, please feel free to attached here.\nThank you. ","2026-01-08T07:11:07.265Z"],["3794284","EBIKE1-390","EBIKE1","erki.saarik@bolt.eu","Erki Saarik","Samples from WheelTop should arrive to LY {{2026-01-10}} ","2026-01-08T07:11:12.065Z"],["3794285","WFM-9872","WFM","jana.mariakova@bolt.eu","Jana Marjakova-Līdeka","Hey [~accountid:712020:d706766d-8b50-4da6-9056-6d3a20ccaddb], \nI see that the queues just disappeared from your profile. I now escalated this issue to Assemble to investigate, and I will come back when the issue is fixed.\nMy apologies for the inconvenience. ","2026-01-08T07:11:53.449Z"],["3794286","PFI-830314","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This Early Cashout was rejected by the bank; the provider returned a generic UPI error and did not provide a clear human-readable reason. Please inform the partner to verify their payout details (UPI ID/bank linkage, account holder name, and account status) and try the Early Cashout again; otherwise, the amount will be included in the next regular payout cycle automatically. If you need anything else, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:12:21.665Z"],["3794290","PFI-830382","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The Early Cashout requested on 29 Dec is still pending; the last log on 5 Jan shows payment validation in progress. As this update is recent, please inform the courier it’s being processed and should reflect on their bank account soon—we are monitoring and will handle any compliance requests promptly. If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. Please note the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:13:21.465Z"],["3794292","PFI-830391","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is in rejected state and the bank/payment provider did not return a clear rejection reason. It will be reprocessed automatically in the next regular payout cycle; if this was an Early Cashout, the partner can try requesting it again. If the issue persists after the next cycle, please reply to this ticket for further checks. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:13:57.600Z"],["3794293","PFI-830410","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed and completed on 2026-01-07. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still don’t see the funds, ask them to check with their bank using the proof. If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:14:15.296Z"],["3794294","PFI-830423","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed with value date 2025-12-29. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still cannot locate the funds—especially given the closed account—ask them to contact their bank to trace the transfer. Also ensure the partner updates their active bank details in the app to avoid future issues.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:14:41.610Z"],["3794296","PFI-830435","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still in progress: the bank has accepted the transfer and is processing it, which is within the normal timeline given the last update on 2026-01-05. Please inform the partner that the funds should reflect on their account shortly. We are monitoring pending payouts; if it’s still not visible after 1–2 business days, please ask the partner to check with their (beneficiary) bank. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:14:56.714Z"],["3794297","CCM-22264","CCM","kewalin.manmor@bolt.eu","Kewalin Manmor","[^Copy of New TalentLMS Training Request Form.xlsx]","2026-01-08T07:14:58.262Z"],["3794299","WD-22514","WD","siret.saks@bolt.eu","Siret Saks","!Screenshot 2026-01-08 at 09.06.47.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T07:15:16.134Z"],["3794301","PFI-830447","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout was rejected by the bank, and the provider did not return a clear rejection reason. Please inform the partner that it will be reprocessed in the next regular payout cycle; if this was an Early Cashout, they can try to request it again now. To prevent another failure, ask them to double-check their beneficiary bank details (IBAN/account number, name, bank, currency). \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase; feel free to share any feedback.","2026-01-08T07:15:34.754Z"],["3794302","LSS-59921","LSS","liivika.tamm@bolt.eu","Liivika Tamm","Thank you! Should you need any further support with this, feel free to reopen the ticket!","2026-01-08T07:15:36.934Z"],["3794303","LSS-57469","LSS","roger.bjorkbacka@bolt.eu","Roger Björkbacka","Hi, KTH got back asking if the KTH NDA template can be used instead of ours? Before getting back to them would like to ask our position on this?\n\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H1OCxNnsPdRHy7krL1FsJLYQwGIjIBlz/edit|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H1OCxNnsPdRHy7krL1FsJLYQwGIjIBlz/edit|smart-link] \n\n[~accountid:712020:a5138bac-89ac-4e8d-8ec1-5cefe090c9a3] \n\n","2026-01-08T07:15:37.788Z"],["3794304","PFI-830482","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed and is marked as Completed in our system. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still cannot see the funds, they can use it to ask their bank to trace the transfer. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:15:55.138Z"],["3794306","DSR-3581","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-08T07:16:12.833Z"],["3794308","PFI-830486","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout created on 29 Dec is still in pending state; since it’s been pending for over a week, this is likely due to an ongoing compliance review or technical processing on the provider’s side. We are monitoring it and will respond to any provider requests immediately; no action is required from the partner right now. It will be processed as soon as the hold clears and the status will update in the app. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:16:47.644Z"],["3794309","PFI-830502","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still in progress—the latest log on 2026-01-07 shows it was accepted by the bank for processing and remains pending. As it’s very recent, please inform the partner it should settle and reflect in the app/bank within 1–2 business days. If it doesn’t update after that, we will keep monitoring for any delays. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:17:19.310Z"],["3794311","PFI-830505","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout was successfully processed on 2026-01-07 (state: finished). Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the driver; if funds still aren’t visible, ask them to contact their beneficiary bank and use the proof to trace the transfer. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:17:48.083Z"],["3794312","RNTL-29469","RNTL","vinicius.ambrosi@bolt.eu","Vinicius Ambrosi","The same icon is used for this FAB across all verticals and we don’t wanna create an inconsistency, hence this work is dropped.","2026-01-08T07:17:55.093Z"],["3794313","PFI-830518","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed on 2026-01-07. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still cannot see the funds, advise them to check with their beneficiary bank. If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:18:05.482Z"],["3794315","PFI-830534","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still pending; the last log entry on 2025-12-29 shows “payment validation in progress,” which indicates an ongoing compliance review on the provider’s side. Since it has been pending longer than usual, delays are expected, and our team is actively monitoring and responding to any requests from the provider. Please inform the driver that the payout will be processed as soon as the review completes and will reflect on their bank account afterward.\nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase—thanks for any feedback.","2026-01-08T07:18:27.292Z"],["3794316","IOTTEAM-258","IOTTEAM","aare.palm@bolt.eu","Aare Palm","This is finished?","2026-01-08T07:18:43.161Z"],["3794317","PFI-830548","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout is still in Pending status; the last update was on 2026-01-05, which is within normal processing time. Please let the partner know it is being processed and should reach the beneficiary bank shortly—allow 1–2 more business days; if it remains pending beyond 2–3 business days, we are monitoring it and will handle any compliance checks promptly. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase; please share any feedback.","2026-01-08T07:18:58.934Z"],["3794318","PFI-830559","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The courier’s Early Cashout attempt on 05 Jan 2026 was rejected by the payment provider, and no specific reason was returned. Please ask the courier to try requesting Early Cashout again; if it still fails, have them double-check the beneficiary name and bank/IBAN details in the app. If they choose not to retry, the funds will be sent automatically in the next regular payout cycle. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase; feedback is welcome.","2026-01-08T07:19:34.147Z"],["3794319","IOTTEAM-214","IOTTEAM","aare.palm@bolt.eu","Aare Palm","If no planned work for this, let’s close it.\n\nIf something new comes up, let’s create another ticket.","2026-01-08T07:19:35.398Z"],["3794321","PFI-830620","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout was rejected because the beneficiary account number on file is invalid (it doesn’t match the bank’s required format). Please ask the partner to update their bank details with the correct account number (exact digits, correct length, no typos/spaces) and save the changes. After the fix, the payout will be reprocessed in the next regular payout cycle; if this was an Early Cashout, they can try submitting it again. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:20:00.103Z"],["3794322","IOTTEAM-18","IOTTEAM","aare.palm@bolt.eu","Aare Palm","What is the status with this?","2026-01-08T07:20:20.841Z"],["3794323","PFI-830625","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The early cashout created on 6 Dec 2025 is still in pending status, and given the extended delay, it’s most likely held due to an ongoing compliance review or a technical issue on the payment provider’s side. Please let the partner know that the Partner Payments team is actively monitoring these pending payouts and responding to any provider requests as soon as they arrive; no action is needed from their side right now. We will update the ticket as soon as the status changes or the payout is completed.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:20:28.083Z"],["3794326","PFI-830628","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed; the last status is finished with value date 2025-12-08. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still cannot locate the funds, ask them to inquire with their beneficiary bank using the proof. If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:20:50.946Z"],["3794327","IOTTEAM-20","IOTTEAM","aare.palm@bolt.eu","Aare Palm","What is the status of this?","2026-01-08T07:21:13.010Z"],["3794328","PFI-830636","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The Early Cashout is still in pending status and has been pending longer than usual; this typically happens due to a compliance review or technical delays on the provider’s side. We are actively monitoring it and responding to any provider checks to move it forward. Please inform the partner that no action is required on their side for now and we will update this ticket as soon as the status changes.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:21:15.407Z"],["3794329","PFI-830703","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed (state: finished) with value date 2026-01-05; the last log update was on 2026-01-06. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still cannot see the funds, advise them to contact their receiving bank for a trace. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:21:30.624Z"],["3794330","PFI-830748","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is currently pending and was just created on 07 Jan 2026; it has been accepted for processing by the bank and should reach the Fleet Owner’s account within 1–2 business days. Please ask the partner to wait; if it’s still not received after 2–3 business days, they can check with their bank while we continue to monitor it. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-08T07:21:59.826Z"],["3794332","PFI-824730","PFI","mykhailo.stepanov@bolt-outsource.eu","Mykhailo Stepanov"," Any updates with his payment?","2026-01-08T07:22:01.743Z"],["3794334","HS-28670","HS","sitang.wasuthit@bolt.eu","Sitang Wasuthit","The letter is well received. Thank you once again Berit!","2026-01-08T07:22:19.745Z"],["3794335","PFI-830754","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout is currently pending; the latest log on 2026-01-07 shows it was just submitted to the bank channel and is still being processed, so it should reach the account within 1–2 business days. If it remains pending beyond 2–3 business days, it may be due to a compliance or provider delay—we are monitoring and will act on any checks promptly.  \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-08T07:22:28.533Z"],["3794336","IOTTEAM-51","IOTTEAM","aare.palm@bolt.eu","Aare Palm","Let’s discuss on next 1:1, what can we do about that","2026-01-08T07:22:59.235Z"],["3794338","IOTTEAM-96","IOTTEAM","aare.palm@bolt.eu","Aare Palm","please update the status","2026-01-08T07:23:31.510Z"],["3794344","PFI-830830","PFI","raimot.adeleke@bolt-outsource.eu","Raimot Adeleke","!IMG_6901.jpeg.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T07:25:40.728Z"],["3794346","WFM-9841","WFM","jana.mariakova@bolt.eu","Jana Marjakova-Līdeka","Hey [~accountid:5eec8090b04ccf0aae7da19f],\nWe are waiting for your reply. \nPlease note that if you are unable to reply by Friday, we will close this ticket. ","2026-01-08T07:26:22.349Z"],["3794349","HS-28691","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","Task sent to Global Mobility.","2026-01-08T07:27:25.348Z"],["3794353","PFI-830832","PFI","vlad-gabriel.ene@bolt.eu","Vlad-Gabriel Ene","[^Haplea Coressi.pdf]\n\n[^Haplea Iuliu Maniu.pdf]\n\n[^Haplea Magnolia.pdf]\n\n[^Haplea Weiss.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9072400.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9072413.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9072427.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9072428.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9243925.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9244168.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9244423.pdf]\n\n[^RO1425-9245241.pdf]","2026-01-08T07:28:17.493Z"],["3794354","L10N-26388","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26384](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26384)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-08T07:28:19.414Z"],["3794355","L10N-26389","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26384](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26384)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-08T07:28:19.427Z"],["3794356","L10N-26392","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic act