 of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26384](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26384)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-08T07:28:24.955Z"],["3794362","WFM-9886","WFM","jana.mariakova@bolt.eu","Jana Marjakova-Līdeka","Hey [~accountid:712020:d706766d-8b50-4da6-9056-6d3a20ccaddb], \r\n\r\nAs I replied in the previous ticket, I escalated this issue to Assembled. Queues disappear after I add them. I will temporarily assign these queues, but you might lose them again until Assembled fixes this. \r\n\r\nI will inform you about updates. ","2026-01-08T07:28:29.073Z"],["3794366","HS-28680","HS","berit.mustonen@bolt.eu","Berit Mustonen","Amendment signed. ","2026-01-08T07:30:39.698Z"],["3794367","HS-28724","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","No sick leave in [eesti.ee|http://eesti.ee] yet.","2026-01-08T07:30:42.814Z"],["3794369","HS-28723","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","No sick leave in [http://eesti.ee|http://eesti.ee|smart-link]  yet.","2026-01-08T07:30:55.885Z"],["3794370","PFI-829471","PFI","laura.loaiza@bolt.eu","Laura Cristina Muñoz","New case: [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/718823442|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/718823442]\n\nBusiness profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/280015?tab=business_company|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/280015?tab=business_company]","2026-01-08T07:31:06.472Z"],["3794371","LSS-61242","LSS","liivika.tamm@bolt.eu","Liivika Tamm","Hey [~accountid:712020:140cd5da-13da-4a76-91d2-dc8a151f6472] Thank you for raising the ticket!\n\nTo meet expectations, I’m letting you know that I’m able to take this on in the beginning of next week. Hopefully it’s fine!","2026-01-08T07:31:09.632Z"],["3794372","LSS-50913","LSS","beatrice.grize@bolt.eu","Beatričė Grižė","Hello [~accountid:5b8d306bfa38ae2c89608b95], thank you for this information. \nYes, you remember correctly! Please share signed agreement in the comments for archiving purposes, thank you very much. \n\nIf you will have any additional questions, please let me know 🙏  ","2026-01-08T07:31:40.299Z"],["3794375","HS-28670","HS","berit.mustonen@bolt.eu","Berit Mustonen","You are more than welcome 🙂 ","2026-01-08T07:32:35.276Z"],["3794378","LSS-61209","LSS","alessandro@bolt.eu","Alessandro Milici","Hello [~accountid:622f787a1f014e0069cc0d85], apologies for the change, but would it be possible to remove Mahaut de Lesquen and obtain only Ahto’s signature for this document? We just double-checked with legal. \n\nThank you \n\nAlessandro ","2026-01-08T07:33:10.297Z"],["3794379","PFI-830835","PFI","kosisochukwu.ochuaka@bolt-outsource.eu","Kosisochukwu Ochuaka","[^absa bank payment detail.pdf (efa7ada6-46ca-4ef1-bf7a-0a621f75e837).pdf]\n\n!image-20260108-072946.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260108-072957.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260108-073014.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T07:33:20.422Z"],["3794380","C2-455","C2","konstantin.karhu@bolt.eu","Konstantin Karhu","Received batteries stored on the bottom of battery rack in the “bunker”, wrapped in bubble wrap.","2026-01-08T07:33:39.828Z"],["3794382","DSR-3573","DSR","ignacio.vrtal@bolt.eu","Ignacio Agustin Vrtal","The user has follow up with the following: \n\n“I did not request this bolt ride and.did not take this trip. Please check you security protocall because my account must have been hacked. Please confirm if there have been any similar complaints against this driver or against Bolt in London.”\n\nI’ve instructed T2 on how to proceed to check the compromised accoutn and reply regarding the confirmation of driver complaints.","2026-01-08T07:34:49.118Z"],["3794384","PFI-829471","PFI","laura.loaiza@bolt.eu","Laura Cristina Muñoz","New case: [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/719180618|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/719180618]\n\nBusiness profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/369191?tab=business_company|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/369191?tab=business_company]","2026-01-08T07:36:20.372Z"],["3794387","DRAG101-428","DRAG101","martin.petrov@bolt.eu","Martin Petrov","Pre-assembled without glue as Snow told and all brackets are pre-assembled. ","2026-01-08T07:37:44.923Z"],["3794391","EBIKE1-421","EBIKE1","guglielmo.fontanarava@bolt.eu","Guglielmo Fontana-Rava Andreae","Yes, correct! We dont have to rush on this project (for a change :sweat_smile:).\nAnd we need to win first.\nWhat we might need is a better render. I will check with Policy team.","2026-01-08T07:38:31.328Z"],["3794394","BDB-1500","BDB","tracy.watiri@bolt.eu","Peace Watiri","[~accountid:712020:c7e5b826-6f9d-454b-83a6-a7755ef1ff9c] Hey [~accountid:712020:c7e5b826-6f9d-454b-83a6-a7755ef1ff9c] I did update the copy you suggested on the media plan and that is what [~accountid:712020:aa01e2da-d94d-4529-a5fb-d7a1a21e0b79] is using. The middle one that you suggested isn’t relevant to the season, celebration is over and we are in January. Train in and Bolt out does make sense because we are capturing that last mile into the T2/T3 cities.","2026-01-08T07:39:13.295Z"],["3794395","PFI-829471","PFI","laura.loaiza@bolt.eu","Laura Cristina Muñoz","New case: [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/719127771|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/719127771]\n\nBusiness profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/331506?tab=business_company|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/331506?tab=business_company] ","2026-01-08T07:39:19.938Z"],["3794400","PFI-812940","PFI","aisma.austruma@bolt.eu","Aisma Austruma","Hello team! Are there any updates here? [~accountid:712020:5c8bc485-83b5-47c2-ba7a-e8927f399b6f] ","2026-01-08T07:41:00.295Z"],["3794401","LSS-61234","LSS","julia.maal@bolt.eu","Julia Maal","Hey [~accountid:712020:ae4fba9f-a97d-41eb-8fd7-bec2a5bc17d0]! I’ll aim to complete the review by the end of the next week. Would that work? ","2026-01-08T07:41:03.629Z"],["3794404","CRC-2360","CRC","kristiina.taube@bolt.eu","Kristiina Taube","[~accountid:5f23e67bfa591d0015b8af39] Hi! Based on slack I see that [~accountid:6215e9f4347c690072f6f91d] is currently OOO. The response deadline (13 Jan) is approaching and we need the details asked about in this ticket already before that (latest end of this week - 9 Jan). Could you help with or is there anyone else who can give input here? \n\nThe details we are asking about here we either need to state in our response to the DNB or we need them in order to draft our argumentation that our payments setup in the NL does not require any financial services licensing. \n\nThanks 🙏 ","2026-01-08T07:41:44.034Z"],["3794408","PFI-826560","PFI","vlad-gabriel.ene@bolt.eu","Vlad-Gabriel Ene","Hi Ketlin! Thank you for your answer. The previous IBAN, which was incorrect, was RO61BTRLRONCRT0553973901. The correct one, where we need to re-transfer the money, is RO12BTRLRONCRT0608662801. I have created a ticket as instructed here: \n\n[https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/PFI-830832|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/PFI-830832|smart-card]\n\n Could you please let me know if the request I raised is correct as I did not find something named “Partner Payment SD”. Thank you!","2026-01-08T07:42:44.897Z"],["3794409","EBIKE1-421","EBIKE1","guglielmo.fontanarava@bolt.eu","Guglielmo Fontana-Rava Andreae","Indeed, they confirmed that a better render would help for the bid.","2026-01-08T07:42:45.934Z"],["3794411","LSS-61219","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi, please find the signed document attached.\n\n[^Cooperation agreement_Bolt Operations OÜ_Nova Mobility UG_01.01.26.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-08T07:44:01.128Z"],["3794412","DRAG101-428","DRAG101","aydin.zengin@bolt.eu","Aydın Zengin","All the phone holder brackets are produced and assembled in LY. So the only option is to glue it during upfitting. \n\n[~accountid:5eb363355862510b794e3507] shared a test video, and here you can see that the phone doesn’t rotate much during the test. \n\n!c14ad3458b2809ef43451724f1039d6e.mp4|width=720,alt=\"c14ad3458b2809ef43451724f1039d6e.mp4\"!","2026-01-08T07:44:13.792Z"],["3794415","DRAG101-428","DRAG101","martin.petrov@bolt.eu","Martin Petrov","[~accountid:6130627ef0bf520069526076] 😭 bad","2026-01-08T07:45:25.676Z"],["3794416","WFM-9858","WFM","shushan.amirjanyan@bolt-outsource.eu","Shushan Amirjanyan","the agent now has the access. Thank you. ","2026-01-08T07:45:38.051Z"],["3794418","DRAG101-428","DRAG101","martin.petrov@bolt.eu","Martin Petrov","[~accountid:6130627ef0bf520069526076] I did some troubleshooting here [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/DRAG101-428?focusedCommentId=3793847|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/DRAG101-428?focusedCommentId=3793847|smart-link] . We still need to modify the injection mold for the next moldings.","2026-01-08T07:47:12.188Z"],["3794426","EBIKE1-318","EBIKE1","hendrik.vorno@bolt.eu","Hendrik Võrno","Lofandi sent new firmware. Need to test :loading: ","2026-01-08T07:51:03.697Z"],["3794427","RCE-328","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Sergei Jakovlev [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1767858706005409]*{color}:\nYep, The main issue is that tooling needs a list of drivers, which can be a bit annoying to get, but for reasonable numbers (e.g. 10k suspended SA drivers yesterday evening) driver search and CSV export work fine. Practically in this specific case, though, we probably want to schedule new identification instead so that they do get another identification when the rollout proceeds (if only unblocked, they will still get verified, but I think it might happen a bit later as the logic for drivers with missing verifications detects them and schedules new selfie check). But in both cases the batch tooling has the same limitation.\n{quote}","2026-01-08T07:52:00.808Z"],["3794433","WFM-9886","WFM","jana.mariakova@bolt.eu","Jana Marjakova-Līdeka","I added queues manually now. It might happen that they will again disappear. I will keep this ticket open until the issue is fixed.","2026-01-08T07:53:38.342Z"],["3794434","LSS-61146","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","hi [~accountid:618b80b7785cb2006aff7ccd] \n\nWe received your request and will proceed with the review of the MSA [https://attio.com/legal/terms-and-conditions|https://attio.com/legal/terms-and-conditions|smart-link] , I saw you added link to Privacy ticket ","2026-01-08T07:53:47.085Z"],["3794435","LSS-57542","LSS","beatrice.grize@bolt.eu","Beatričė Grižė","Hello [~accountid:712020:d3fd53e6-f124-4770-a577-b09d6688566f], thanks! Could you please provide email addresses for these signatories: Mads Wind, Kim Meikel Rose?\nThanks!","2026-01-08T07:53:51.115Z"],["3794436","CEBF-1811","CEBF","serhii.kostyhin@bolt.eu","Serhii Kostyhin","[~accountid:712020:fc274657-f7b5-4366-9f2d-5ec68865cf48] can we reproduce this bug?","2026-01-08T07:54:11.649Z"],["3794437","DELIVERY-1757","DELIVERY","marius.geanta@bolt.eu","Marius-Florin Geantă","Migration instructions from [~accountid:5d15daceb8c82e0c0ff146c9] :\n\n# Check if any custom fees are set for the Bulgaria providers. To check this you can run\n\n{noformat}SELECT \nJSON_EXTRACT(courier_pricing_config_json, '$.ratesV2'),\nJSON_EXTRACT(courier_pricing_config_json, '$.min_courier_earning_batching') \nFROM taxify_delivery_provider.provider \nWHERE \ncurrency = 'bgn' AND (\n(\n\tJSON_CONTAINS_PATH(courier_pricing_config_json, 'one', '$.ratesV2')\n\tAND JSON_LENGTH(JSON_EXTRACT(courier_pricing_config_json, '$.ratesV2')) > 0\n)\nOR JSON_CONTAINS_PATH(courier_pricing_config_json, 'one', '$.min_courier_earning_batching'));{noformat}\n\nIf the results contains lines with custom rates set, then the {{DeliveryProviderConvertProviderDeliveryFeesCron}}  cron needs to be started by changing the dynamic config from here [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/dynamic-config/entity/edit/ZGVsaXZlcnktcHJvdmlkZXItY3Jvbi9[…]X2NvbnZlcnRfZGVsaXZlcnlfZmVlc19jcm9uL3Nob3VsZF9ydW4=/:shard|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/dynamic-config/entity/edit/ZGVsaXZlcnktcHJvdmlkZXItY3Jvbi9jcm9uL3Byb3ZpZGVyX2NvbnZlcnRfZGVsaXZlcnlfZmVlc19jcm9uL3Nob3VsZF9ydW4=/:shard]\n\n# Once 1 is completed - update the providers from Bulgaria to use EUR instead of BGN.\n\n{noformat}UPDATE taxify_delivery_provider.provider SET currency = 'eur' WHERE currency='bgn';{noformat}\n\n# Provider fees will be converted automatically on the first Sunday after Jan 1st. There will be logs on kibana - you should look for {{ProviderFee Price Convert}}  message comming from {{DeliveryProviderFeeReportCron}}  cron - this cron does not depend on step 1 and 2.","2026-01-08T07:54:21.521Z"],["3794438","RCE-328","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Sergei Jakovlev [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1767858865260709]*{color}:\n<@U04RDTQ5AJC>, <@U02JFD5KMUH>, please let me know when you want to proceed with this. If you have concerns I am happy to jump on a call after standup regarding this.\n{quote}","2026-01-08T07:54:38.402Z"],["3794439","DELIVERY-1757","DELIVERY","marius.geanta@bolt.eu","Marius-Florin Geantă","Live migration thread: [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C08T2Q5KASH/p1767852720992449|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C08T2Q5KASH/p1767852720992449|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T07:54:40.010Z"],["3794441","RCE-328","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Shreya Bhandari [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1767858946286439]*{color}:\n<@URVM3U4RF> you’ve a sync on your calendar to discuss this today :slightly_smiling_face:\n{quote}","2026-01-08T07:55:57.861Z"],["3794445","WDFT-3605","WDFT","enelys.kalmus@bolt.eu","Enelys Kalmus","I also confirm, thank you @marko ","2026-01-08T07:56:55.231Z"],["3794448","CCM-22264","CCM","taisiia.nahorna@bolt.eu","Taisiia Nahorna","Hello Jane!\n\nI have assigned Business up-skill for [sikarin.seepol@bolt.eu|mailto:sikarin.seepol@bolt.eu] and Safety high and significant up-skill for [ampikar.ouantai@bolt.eu|mailto:ampikar.ouantai@bolt.eu]\n\nTaisiia","2026-01-08T07:57:37.932Z"],["3794450","PFI-820777","PFI","innaaime.kalju@bolt.eu","Inna Aime Kalju","please help us with the case, its open since 19.12","2026-01-08T07:57:56.710Z"],["3794451","WEBSD-1452","WEBSD","stanley.wu@bolt.eu","Stanley Wu","Hi [~accountid:712020:9e668ce4-0877-43c6-bae9-52f1ecbc753f] ,\n\nLet’s proceed with option 1.\n\nFor English: [https://bolt.eu/en-tw/legal/tnc-anti-money-laundering/?category=other|https://bolt.eu/en-tw/legal/tnc-anti-money-laundering/?category=other|smart-link] \n\nPlease add the link to the highlighted part.\n\n!image-20260108-075554.png|width=2035,height=1062,alt=\"image-20260108-075554.png\"!\n\nFor Chinese: [https://bolt.eu/zh-tw/legal/tnc-anti-money-laundering/?category=other|https://bolt.eu/zh-tw/legal/tnc-anti-money-laundering/?category=other|smart-link] \n\nPlease add the link to the highlighted part.\n\n!image-20260108-075711.png|width=2024,height=1100,alt=\"image-20260108-075711.png\"!\n\n\n\nThanks,\n\nStanley Wu\n\n\n\n","2026-01-08T07:57:59.349Z"],["3794453","LSS-61243","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi! I have created an account for You in SpotDraft. You should have received an invite to Your email. Please let me know in cases of any issues or questions.","2026-01-08T07:58:32.661Z"],["3794455","RCE-328","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Sergei Jakovlev [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1767859106519959]*{color}:\nTrue, thanks! Unless admin is lying to me, we now have _less_ suspended SA drivers with failed selfie check. :thinking_face:\n{quote}","2026-01-08T07:58:40.496Z"],["3794457","WD-22465","WD","mariliis.palo@bolt.eu","Mariliis Palo","Hello! Thanks for the info. My bad indeed as I forgot thats how the vacation set-up is here. All good then :) ","2026-01-08T07:58:54.295Z"],["3794461","DRX-27782","DRX","hardi.hansson@bolt.eu","Hardi Hansson","✅ Tested on DA.126.0 (1502) Firebase build on Samsung A12, OS:13\n\n!Screenshot_20260108_095257_Bolt Driver.jpg|width=144,alt=\"Screenshot_20260108_095257_Bolt Driver.jpg\"!","2026-01-08T07:59:29.683Z"],["3794464","CCM-22245","CCM","taisiia.nahorna@bolt.eu","Taisiia Nahorna","during team sync 7.01 - aligned to remove word ‘final’, so now it’s just 'training survey'","2026-01-08T08:00:11.153Z"],["3794468","PFI-830389","PFI","grigoria.papageorgiou@bolt.eu","Grigoria Papageorgiou","As the payment is not found in that section of Admin, we will wait until  Partner Payments Specialist reviews the request.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-08T08:01:31.498Z"],["3794469","LSS-58768","LSS","polina.novikova@bolt.eu","Polina Novikova","Hey [~accountid:712020:b2a2738f-c1f1-447c-9b72-29851b5fed3e] ,\n\nGreen light from InfoSec.\n\nThanks\n\n[https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/ISS-1102|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/ISS-1102|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T08:01:40.925Z"],["3794470","LSS-61244","LSS","viktoriadebora.raudberg@bolt.eu","Debora Raudberg","[^2025.12 Power of Attorney (Bogdan Clipici).pdf] _(152 kB)_","2026-01-08T08:02:13.219Z"],["3794472","DSR-3583","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-08T08:02:33.086Z"],["3794473","LSS-61206","LSS","alon.alkalay@bolt.eu","Alon Alkalay","Hi [~accountid:712020:6f095333-c438-429c-9660-a9de5d845fe7] - thank you for raising the ticket and I appreciate you thinking about privacy in this way. \n\nIn short, you can proceed (/) \n\nThe reasoning is that:\n\n# We are already combining Hopp and Bolt user data into the same central database (Admin). \n# There are no data localization requirements in Canada requiring Bolt to store user data locally.\n# Bolt Operations OÜ and Hopp have an intra group agreement allowing data sharing between the entities.\n\n*One aspect I want to check with you is where exactly will we be storing Bolt Plus and Hopp Plus incentives data?*","2026-01-08T08:02:39.523Z"],["3794474","DRX-8347","DRX","mykola.mozghovyi@bolt.eu","Mykola Mozghovyi","Ping [~accountid:623194c0442e0e0069ed229c] on/after jan 12th [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/CNKLBL33P/p1767859220254719?thread_ts=1767858812.017409&cid=CNKLBL33P|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/CNKLBL33P/p1767859220254719?thread_ts=1767858812.017409&cid=CNKLBL33P|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T08:03:17.703Z"],["3794477","PFI-830439","PFI","ivaniuk.habriella@bolt-outsource.eu","Ivaniuk Habriella","issue was solved","2026-01-08T08:04:18.596Z"],["3794478","PAW-14700","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was approved by @xenJ\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/160039\nStatus: open\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-08 08:04:55 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-08T08:04:55.828Z"],["3794479","PFI-830849","PFI","jelena.griciva@bolt-outsource.eu","Jelena Griciva","!Screenshot_20260107_190613_Drive.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!Screenshot_20260107_190626_Drive.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T08:04:56.013Z"],["3794480","PFI-829471","PFI","laura.loaiza@bolt.eu","Laura Cristina Muñoz","New case: [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/719478293|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/719478293]\n\nBusiness profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/784844?tab=business_company|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/business-portal/businessCompanies/784844?tab=business_company]","2026-01-08T08:05:00.558Z"],["3794481","LSS-55393","LSS","andrzej.lipson@bolt.eu","Andrzej Lipson","scan is fine!","2026-01-08T08:05:16.763Z"],["3794484","LSS-55393","LSS","andrzej.lipson@bolt.eu","Andrzej Lipson","for Romania I’ve already received a PoA!\n\n","2026-01-08T08:05:51.578Z"],["3794485","SUPX-2301","SUPX","artem.kudlaienko@bolt.eu","Artem Kudlaienko","Parsona resolver - [GitHub|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/b7e75c83c635be34e7fa0580439a2221bef79e3b/src/platform/cs/support_case_personas/main/common/UserPersonaResolver.ts#L198]\n\nArticle labels:\n\n{noformat}labels:\n  - user-type-scooter_rider\n  - user-type-rider\n  - user-type-ebike_rider\n  - user-type-car_rental_user\n  - tier-2{noformat}","2026-01-08T08:06:03.901Z"],["3794486","WD-22512","WD","magnus.vainumae@bolt.eu","Magnus Vainumäe","[~accountid:712020:80f31809-0e9d-4c0f-8939-db5dd3d77922] seems the similar issue here as [+WD-22374+|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/WD-22374]","2026-01-08T08:06:14.211Z"],["3794487","LSS-60741","LSS","alexia.lia@bolt.eu","Alexia Lia","Hello both ! Apologies, was OOO, will read it all thoroughly and get back to you asap!","2026-01-08T08:06:14.623Z"],["3794488","PFI-830850","PFI","seema.matli@bolt.eu","Seema Matli","[^B2500008P10 Remittance Advice.pdf]","2026-01-08T08:06:35.525Z"],["3794490","LSS-60219","LSS","narmin.ahmadova@bolt.eu","Narmin Ahmadova","Hey [~accountid:712020:eb9cd4dd-46ca-47c8-a985-9f940495724a] , \n\nCan you please help clarify the confusion regarding the legal basis? ","2026-01-08T08:06:57.065Z"],["3794491","PFI-829576","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThank you for providing the refund details. I have reached out to Paystack for the refund. Will let you know once we have updates. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-08T08:07:28.483Z"],["3794493","PFI-830435","PFI","augustas.strimaitis@bolt-outsource.eu","Augustas Strimaitis","Thank you, problem solved payout went through. ","2026-01-08T08:08:03.409Z"],["3794495","RS-1921","RS","narmin.ahmadova@bolt.eu","Narmin Ahmadova","Hey [~accountid:5dbb027ba766000da47cf09d] ,\n\nI am a little confused about this ticket. The data was disclosed, but I am unsure on which legal basis.","2026-01-08T08:08:22.063Z"],["3794499","PFI-830851","PFI","parani.tanasiriphong@bolt-outsource.eu","Parani Tanasiriphong","!image-20260108-080133.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260108-080154.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260108-080209.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T08:08:40.130Z"],["3794502","PFI-830825","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi Team,\n\nI've reviewed the case and everything is correct on Bolt's end. The preauthorisation was successfully released, and there is no further action required from us.\n\nPlease follow the steps in this Knowledge Base article to advise the customer: [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/7109163016850?country=global&language=en|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/7109163016850?country=global&language=en]\n\nAdvise the customer to *check with their bank* to confirm the release of the preauthorisation. Banks handle these releases differently, and while some are immediate, others may process it as a temporary charge that is then refunded. Sometimes, the payment is reversed without the bank sending a reversal notification to the customer, which might lead the user to think that the reversal has not been made.\n\nThe reversal can take up to *30 days* to complete, as pending authorisations typically expire after that time on banks end.\n\nUnfortunately, we don't have full visibility into all the parties involved in the payment processing beyond our payment partner. Therefore, we can't track the exact status of the preauthorisation release once it has been sent.\n\nThank you,\n\nMarten\n\n","2026-01-08T08:09:43.928Z"],["3794503","RDXENG-4507","RDXENG","evamaria.pedosk@bolt.eu","Eva-Maria Pedosk","(/) *Tested on CA.192.0 and OK.*\n\nAs {{option_id}} was initially missing from client side but BE is already sending user selected network option within the event name (e.g. _Preferred Card Network mastercard Option Tapped)_, decided to keep that option and not require additional client change.","2026-01-08T08:09:44.075Z"],["3794504","PFI-830789","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi Team,\n\nI've reviewed the case and everything is correct on Bolt's end. The preauthorisation was successfully released, and there is no further action required from us.\n\nPlease follow the steps in this Knowledge Base article to advise the customer: [https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/7109163016850?country=global&language=en|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/7109163016850?country=global&language=en]\n\nAdvise the customer to *check with their bank* to confirm the release of the preauthorisation. Banks handle these releases differently, and while some are immediate, others may process it as a temporary charge that is then refunded. Sometimes, the payment is reversed without the bank sending a reversal notification to the customer, which might lead the user to think that the reversal has not been made.\n\nThe reversal can take up to *30 days* to complete, as pending authorisations typically expire after that time on banks end.\n\nUnfortunately, we don't have full visibility into all the parties involved in the payment processing beyond our payment partner. Therefore, we can't track the exact status of the preauthorisation release once it has been sent.\n\nThank you,\n\nMarten\n\n","2026-01-08T08:10:08.173Z"],["3794505","LSS-60674","LSS","rayko.chakarov@bolt.eu","Rayko Chakarov","Hello Debora, i already add my comments, so we can proceed , everything looks fine.","2026-01-08T08:10:12.915Z"],["3794506","LSS-60827","LSS","alon.alkalay@bolt.eu","Alon Alkalay","Thanks [~accountid:712020:b1173ea3-13b8-45ee-8e48-2f875612ef84] - in that case, we will close this ticket.","2026-01-08T08:10:14.598Z"],["3794507","LSS-60768","LSS","aveliis.saluveervutt@bolt.eu","Ave-Liis Saluveer-Vutt","[~accountid:712020:7ebf1982-dd36-43fb-a386-42b4b1ee6b59] - it’s been resent to Kamil 🙂 ","2026-01-08T08:10:20.038Z"],["3794508","FDBT-4706","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_data_integration_workiva_workday_report_for_cash_flow_parent fails on 2026-01-07 05:15:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInstance._execute_task_with_callbacks(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3184, in _execute_task_with_callbacks\n    result = self._execute_task(context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3208, in _execute_task\n    return _execute_task(self, context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 771, in _execute_task\n    result = _execute_callable(context=context, **execute_callable_kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 742, in _execute_callable\n    return ExecutionCallableRunner(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/utils/operator_helpers.py\", line 252, in run\n    return self.func(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/baseoperator.py\", line 424, in wrapper\n    return func(self, *args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages