-manager:~# tiup ctl:v8.5.1 pd -u ti-fraud-pd-1.sqldb:2379 store 3563914 | grep \"region_count\"\nStarting component ctl: /root/.tiup/components/ctl/v8.5.1/ctl pd -u ti-fraud-pd-1.sqldb:2379 store 3563914\n    \"region_count\": 0,\n\nroot@ti-manager:~# tiup ctl:v8.5.1 pd -u ti-fraud-pd-1.sqldb:2379 store 3563915 | grep \"region_count\"\nStarting component ctl: /root/.tiup/components/ctl/v8.5.1/ctl pd -u ti-fraud-pd-1.sqldb:2379 store 3563915\n    \"region_count\": 0,\n\nroot@ti-manager:~# tiup ctl:v8.5.1 pd -u ti-fraud-pd-1.sqldb:2379 store 3563916 | grep \"region_count\"\nStarting component ctl: /root/.tiup/components/ctl/v8.5.1/ctl pd -u ti-fraud-pd-1.sqldb:2379 store 3563916\n    \"region_count\": 0,{noformat}\n\n{noformat}There are some nodes can be pruned:\n\tNodes: [ti-fraud-kv1-13.sqldb:20160 ti-fraud-kv1-14.sqldb:20160 ti-fraud-kv1-15.sqldb:20160]\n\tYou can destroy them with the command: `tiup cluster prune ti-fraud`{noformat}","2026-01-08T08:19:28.059Z"],["3794547","SREDO-418","SREDO","lauri.linros@bolt.eu","Lauri Linros","[https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdkref/latest/guide/feature-sts-regionalized-endpoints.html|https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdkref/latest/guide/feature-sts-regionalized-endpoints.html|smart-link] \n\n[https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02LJSS27Q8/p1767776445098679?thread_ts=1767774867.630639&cid=C02LJSS27Q8|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02LJSS27Q8/p1767776445098679?thread_ts=1767774867.630639&cid=C02LJSS27Q8|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T08:19:35.407Z"],["3794549","RS-1928","RS","narmin.ahmadova@bolt.eu","Narmin Ahmadova","Hey [~accountid:6001a723d364960139286c95] ,\n\nCan you please make sure a non-valid legal basis is up-to-date once a new legal basis is verified🙏 ","2026-01-08T08:19:43.415Z"],["3794550","BDB-1500","BDB","polina.petuhhova@bolt.eu","Polina Petuhhova","[~accountid:6290ab2fab91fe00709a0d7c] Let’s please wait for [~accountid:712020:c7e5b826-6f9d-454b-83a6-a7755ef1ff9c] input! ","2026-01-08T08:20:20.631Z"],["3794552","DO-5772","DO","felix.woll@bolt.eu","Felix Wöll","Ah, understood. Sorry, that was not clear from your question.\nI don't know if IT normally creates such groups, but I also have the possibility as an Admin, so I should be able to create them for you as well. I don't think that IT uses terraform for that.\n\nCan you tell me for which user attribute(s) you need it hand how the group(s) should be named?","2026-01-08T08:20:27.919Z"],["3794553","CSDA-291","CSDA",null,"Automation for Jira","Thank you for raising a request to our team!\nWe review all new project requests every Monday morning. We'll update you once the request is reviewed and internally assigned.","2026-01-08T08:20:38.767Z"],["3794556","FX-3561","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Joel Palgi [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1767860530004969]*{color}:\nGit commit hooks are only run on changed files. the mock data file was not changed, but had errors, due to API generation\n{quote}","2026-01-08T08:22:23.438Z"],["3794557","DBRE-8586","DBRE","sangsun.bae@bolt.eu","Sangsun Bae","* was-backup disk expansion\n* [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C032VGUKR3K/p1767860503400959|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C032VGUKR3K/p1767860503400959]\n* [https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/15288|https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/15288]","2026-01-08T08:22:32.358Z"],["3794559","BDB-1500","BDB","tracy.watiri@bolt.eu","Peace Watiri","[~accountid:712020:aa01e2da-d94d-4529-a5fb-d7a1a21e0b79] I’m a bit unclear on what specific input is being requested here. We’ve already agreed to use the same copy [~accountid:712020:c7e5b826-6f9d-454b-83a6-a7755ef1ff9c]  suggested across all the artworks, with the only change being translation into Swahili.\n\nTanzania is a very unique market and English is not the first language for most users. If we’re unable to rely on visuals that strongly resonate with them, then the language needs to do that work.","2026-01-08T08:22:49.069Z"],["3794560","DO-5772","DO","hassan.farooq@bolt.eu","Hassan Farooq","*user_attribute =* {{fpa_restriction}}\n\n*value* = {{fpa_group_headcount}}","2026-01-08T08:22:51.756Z"],["3794562","DBRE-8586","DBRE","sangsun.bae@bolt.eu","Sangsun Bae","* fleet-backup custom export too old\n* [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C032VGUKR3K/p1767856108696799|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C032VGUKR3K/p1767856108696799|smart-link] \n* [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SRE/pages/6513590981/MySQL+custom+export#MySQLCustomExportTooOld|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SRE/pages/6513590981/MySQL+custom+export#MySQLCustomExportTooOld|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T08:23:13.838Z"],["3794567","RS-1932","RS","narmin.ahmadova@bolt.eu","Narmin Ahmadova","Hey [~accountid:615c1af4048360006a44e16c] [~accountid:6012aaf8a41ea5006a613a63] ,\n\nIn this case, I would suggest informing the Police that we can not locate the order so far, and we would appreciate additional details to do our investigation. ","2026-01-08T08:23:53.607Z"],["3794569","DBRE-8593","DBRE","susana.oroz@bolt.eu","Susana Salazar Oroz","{noformat}root@ti-manager:~# tiup cluster prune ti-fraud\n...\n+ [ Serial ] - FindTomestoneNodes\nWill destroy these nodes: [ti-fraud-kv1-13.sqldb:20160 ti-fraud-kv1-14.sqldb:20160 ti-fraud-kv1-15.sqldb:20160]\nDo you confirm this action? [y/N]:(default=N) y\nStart destroy Tombstone nodes: [ti-fraud-kv1-13.sqldb:20160 ti-fraud-kv1-14.sqldb:20160 ti-fraud-kv1-15.sqldb:20160] ...\n...\n+ [ Serial ] - RemoveTomestoneNodesInPD\nDestroy success{noformat}\n\n{noformat}root@ti-manager:~# tiup cluster display ti-fraud | grep tikv | awk '{print $1, $6}'\nti-fraud-kv1-1.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-10.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-11.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-12.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-2.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-3.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-4.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-5.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-6.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-7.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-8.sqldb:20160 Up\nti-fraud-kv1-9.sqldb:20160 Up{noformat}","2026-01-08T08:24:03.771Z"],["3794572","PAW-14703","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was merged\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/autocode/pull/50\nStatus: merged\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-08 08:24:25 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-08T08:24:25.856Z"],["3794573","WD-22415","WD","yuvraj.chhikara@bolt.eu","Yuvraj Chhikara","Hi [~accountid:63934c5900cb2fc3f98c7e44] , thanks for writing. I see that the schedule was correctly setup and launched on the correct time \n\n\n!image-20260108-082357.png|width=657,alt=\"image-20260108-082357.png\"!\n\nI will investigate it further and get back to you over slack with more details. And report output.\n\nThanks","2026-01-08T08:24:33.622Z"],["3794574","DRAG101-448","DRAG101","aydin.zengin@bolt.eu","Aydın Zengin","[~accountid:5e4a421e691b8a0c95c2cdec] Added in the HW improvements list for the next batch. ","2026-01-08T08:24:56.406Z"],["3794575","LSS-59775","LSS","elisabetta.furfarojerusalmy@bolt.eu","Elisabetta Furfaro Jerusalmy","Hi all,\n\nI guess we can now close this ticket right [~accountid:6169660ebfa2c1006b56c18f] ?\n\nThanks\n\nElisabetta","2026-01-08T08:26:02.539Z"],["3794576","LSS-60674","LSS","viktoriadebora.raudberg@bolt.eu","Debora Raudberg","Hey, [~accountid:712020:5cf40694-0837-4f72-b92a-c4936529065f], I see your comments only in the Special Terms. Can you please comment in the General Terms too? I need you to check clauses 4.1, 4.4, 5.7, 6.1, 6.5, 7.2, 7.6, 7.8 and Schedule 1 clause 1.1. Here is the link: [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dJIwxQM3MZBaDbAZaMLLTjoDJGAUA31x/edit|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dJIwxQM3MZBaDbAZaMLLTjoDJGAUA31x/edit|smart-link]. Thank you!","2026-01-08T08:26:02.573Z"],["3794577","PFI-830769","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nI’m not able to find the payment with the information provided. \nCould you please ask for the users bank statement where there would be additional information available. \nThe most useful piece of information is the payment descriptor that should look like this - [Bolt.eu/O/1231412312|http://Bolt.eu/O/1231412312]\n\nLet me know once you receive additional information! \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-08T08:26:20.764Z"],["3794578","PFI-812577","PFI","felicia.oprea@bolt-outsource.eu","Felicia Ștefania Oprea","Hello, \n\nAny updates? \n\nThank you\n","2026-01-08T08:26:23.069Z"],["3794581","DBRE-8586","DBRE","sangsun.bae@bolt.eu","Sangsun Bae","* ti-fraud down scale\n* [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C03055EHHPS/p1767860654113619|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C03055EHHPS/p1767860654113619|smart-link] \n* [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/GFGTF111A/p1767860711116979|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/GFGTF111A/p1767860711116979|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T08:26:52.972Z"],["3794583","DRX-27781","DRX","hardi.hansson@bolt.eu","Hardi Hansson","✅ Tested on DA.126.0 (1502) Firebase build on Samsung A12, OS:13\n\n!Recording_20260108_100046.mp4|width=320,alt=\"Recording_20260108_100046.mp4\"!","2026-01-08T08:26:58.618Z"],["3794585","DRX-27793","DRX","hardi.hansson@bolt.eu","Hardi Hansson","✅ Tested on DA.126.0 (1502) Firebase build on Samsung A12, OS:13\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-08 at 10.09.13.png|width=154,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-08 at 10.09.13.png\"!","2026-01-08T08:27:50.208Z"],["3794586","TAX2-570","TAX2","justyna.szponar@bolt.eu","Justyna Szponar","[~accountid:62ea2a695111209f4fde8265] no,  do not see apart from already known issues. As long as Taiwan does not require separate reporting for individuals and businesses and we do not allow WP customers to be in re-seller model - nothing to add from VAT perspective. Thank you.","2026-01-08T08:28:10.103Z"],["3794591","LSS-60694","LSS","irene.cobian@bolt.eu","Irene Cobian Martin","Thanks! I will reach out to them 🙂 ","2026-01-08T08:29:17.629Z"],["3794592","DSR-3009","DSR","sigrid.hobejarv@bolt.eu","Sigrid Hõbejärv","I have sent the data and letter to the user","2026-01-08T08:29:21.077Z"],["3794593","CEBF-1815","CEBF","bophana.ros@bolt.eu","Bophana Ros","Task is completed. \n\n!2026-01-08_10-29-21.mp4|width=537,alt=\"2026-01-08_10-29-21.mp4\"!","2026-01-08T08:29:43.820Z"],["3794595","BDB-1500","BDB","tracy.watiri@bolt.eu","Peace Watiri","[~accountid:712020:c7e5b826-6f9d-454b-83a6-a7755ef1ff9c] All the copies are now the same as your suggestion. They have all been translated into Swahili. We’d like the artwork in SW given recent developments","2026-01-08T08:30:25.218Z"],["3794597","PFA-561","PFA","ach.rozie@bolt.eu","Achmad Rozie","Under asking to Greg\n\n\n\n*[How* {{predicted_issue_key}} *on support_case_context is generated?* _--upstream flow behind this table_*]*Hello Greg, want to ask regarding event {{predicted_issue_key}}\n\n* based on your last explanation - this should be under customer support service (cmiiw)\n* I don't know I should ask this to whom, previously discussed with Anton and Hena, but since they are on OOO - maybe I will drop this here first.\n\nThe questions\n\n* is all of these things stored in the {{sel_customer_support_spark.support_case_context}} ? (data and [+notebook+|https://bolt-common.cloud.databricks.com/editor/notebooks/1826463772094881?o=3598988355446810#command/7109144182589046] is attached)\n* or maybe is there any source on top of {{predicted_issue_key}} that contribute to {{sel_customer_support_spark.support_case_context}} (column: {{support_case_context}}) (let say from llm)\n\nAdditional notes:\n\n* Hena also even provide me attached diagram regarding this - but not sure yet is {{predicted_issue_key}} and {{llm_issue_detection}} in support_case_event are generating the {{predicted_issue_key}} is {{sel_customer_support_spark.support_case_context}}","2026-01-08T08:31:07.307Z"],["3794607","LSS-59862","LSS","liisa.puu@bolt.eu","Liisa Puu","I will aks input form stakeholder once more. ","2026-01-08T08:32:31.112Z"],["3794609","FDBT-4746","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-08T08:32:44.384Z"],["3794610","MM-457","MM","aliaksei.sukharau@bolt.eu","Aliaksei Sukharau","Please, review the design doc: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/x/cAHAtgE|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/x/cAHAtgE]","2026-01-08T08:32:51.199Z"],["3794611","HS-28700","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","Waiting information about JD.","2026-01-08T08:32:54.926Z"],["3794613","GRWA-1473","GRWA","zunair.butt@bolt.eu","Muhammad Zunair Butt","[thread|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C08HGQSM47N/p1767700946152029?thread_ts=1767690177.222639&cid=C08HGQSM47N]","2026-01-08T08:33:17.127Z"],["3794614","DBRE-8678","DBRE","kristjan.vedler@bolt.eu","Kristjan Vedler","Cron disabled on live","2026-01-08T08:33:53.401Z"],["3794617","LSS-60533","LSS","polina.novikova@bolt.eu","Polina Novikova","Hi [~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] ,\n\nThey have removed the auto-renewal clause.\n\nCould you please support with signature collection?\n\nThank you.\n\n[^LNKD_ORDER_11437717294.pdf.pdf]\n\n","2026-01-08T08:34:14.972Z"],["3794620","DRAG101-471","DRAG101","klemet-gustav.tamm@bolt.eu","Klemet-Gustav Tamm","[~accountid:5e9a112618b8ed0c0f776390] would it be possible to tackle this task earlier to enable local teams to plan ahead?","2026-01-08T08:34:40.586Z"],["3794621","PFI-830647","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","!image-20260108-083338.png|width=657,alt=\"image-20260108-083338.png\"!\n\nHello, 100 eur was charged as the end negative Balance for October.\n\nThe negative Income of 707.9, which caused the negative Balance is the result of the reversed payments. Please, contact the Partner Payments Team for a reason why\n\n!image-20260108-083429.png|width=657,alt=\"image-20260108-083429.png\"!","2026-01-08T08:34:51.768Z"],["3794622","PFI-830647","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Thank you for submitting this ticket!\n\nLooks like you've selected invalid Request Type which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! \n\n- [Partner Payments] Business made payment, but didn't reflect: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/306\n- [Customer Payments] Business had issues with their credit card: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/303\n\n- Fraud related issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/304\n\n[Billing] - Business invoicing and balance issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/305\n\n[Billing/Tax Tech]- Business invoice has not been reported (Fiscalized) : https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247\n- Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301\n\n\nCheers\nCommerce Team Jira Bot","2026-01-08T08:34:57.746Z"],["3794627","PFI-830864","PFI","sararat.wanthai@bolt-outsource.eu","Sararat Wanthai","!image-20260108-083201.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260108-083215.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T08:35:27.401Z"],["3794628","LSS-60730","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","We’re reopening the ticket, we will add new SOWs and MSA with other suppliers. ","2026-01-08T08:36:02.361Z"],["3794630","LSS-58423","LSS","natalia.fronczuk@bolt.eu","Natalia Frończuk","Hi all, created the promo code now. It will give 100% off for 5 rides, valid from today until the end of May. Code is *LBEZJRJS*","2026-01-08T08:36:37.255Z"],["3794631","RDXENG-3712","RDXENG","pavel.panarad@bolt.eu","Pavel Panarad","[https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/RDXENG-4569|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/RDXENG-4569|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T08:36:51.265Z"],["3794634","LSS-58872","LSS","liisa.puu@bolt.eu","Liisa Puu","08.01.2026: On the meeting 14.12.2025 it was agreed that from legal side there are no blockers. Franchise and procurement teams need to approach our GE partner. \n\n[~accountid:628dd71f40b157006f734818] has there been any updates or there will be within January?\n\nfyi: [~accountid:5d91ad8a1d47a50c34d48412] \n\nLiisa","2026-01-08T08:37:38.074Z"],["3794635","BDB-1500","BDB","liisi.tamra@bolt.eu","Liisi Tamra","[~accountid:6290ab2fab91fe00709a0d7c] As mentioned, we can’t use “Bolt” as a verb, so here are two headline suggestions for the second placement:\n\n*Arrive by train. Leave by ride.*\n*From platform to pickup*","2026-01-08T08:38:22.488Z"],["3794636","LSS-60076","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","hi [~accountid:712020:0f7a089b-3b06-423b-844c-6e5ac370aa1e] \n\nPlease share with Certinal the reviewed Order \n\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-K3eJ31v8q6FVtz29aNY7dcTd_0LRFAm/edit|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-K3eJ31v8q6FVtz29aNY7dcTd_0LRFAm/edit|smart-link] \n\nWe agreed to try to push back to not having termination for convenience, so let’s see what Certinal replies. ","2026-01-08T08:38:29.171Z"],["3794637","LSS-60694","LSS","irene.cobian@bolt.eu","Irene Cobian Martin","Here’s the complete agreement including our details. [~accountid:622f787a1f014e0069cc0d85] looping you in to collect Ahto’s signature 🙂 \n\nThanks!\n\n\n\n[^BOLT CONTRACT AIM_SponsorVELOCITY.ENG (Complete).pdf]\n\n","2026-01-08T08:38:31.275Z"],["3794640","FX-3574","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*FleetX reports [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1767861527790549]*{color}:\nThank you for the report, <@uns>!\n\nOur team duty champion will review [your request|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FX-3574] soon.\n{quote}","2026-01-08T08:39:00.994Z"],["3794642","FX-3575","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*FleetX reports [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1767861528361839]*{color}:\nThank you for the report, <@uns>!\n\nOur team duty champion will review [your request|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FX-3575] soon.\n{quote}","2026-01-08T08:39:12.746Z"],["3794643","RDXENG-3821","RDXENG","evamaria.pedosk@bolt.eu","Eva-Maria Pedosk","(/) *Tested on CI.217.0 and OK.*","2026-01-08T08:39:13.469Z"],["3794644","FX-3574","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Joel Palgi [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1767861559455139]*{color}:\nIncrease batch/concurrency to try to increase getDriverBasicInfo performance and to get less timeouts\n{quote}","2026-01-08T08:39:32.560Z"],["3794645","FX-3575","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Joel Palgi [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1767861562714919]*{color}:\nIncrease batch/concurrency to try to increase getDriverBasicInfo performance and to get less timeouts\n{quote}","2026-01-08T08:39:35.298Z"],["3794647","BDB-1500","BDB","tracy.watiri@bolt.eu","Peace Watiri","[~accountid:712020:aa01e2da-d94d-4529-a5fb-d7a1a21e0b79] Thanks for sharing, looks neat. Couple of changes to the artwork given recent developments kindly.\n\n\n# We have updated the sheet in SW, kindly use the translation in SW\n# Change the name Tuk-Tuk to Bajaji (That’s how it is in-app)\n# For the rate, allow me to check with local ops and update. I don’t sit in the market and do not want to give wrong figures.","2026-01-08T08:39:46.563Z"],["3794648","INSUR-153","INSUR","alessandro@bolt.eu","Alessandro Milici","Done and renewed","2026-01-08T08:39:47.078Z"],["3794650","INSUR-31","INSUR","alessandro@bolt.eu","Alessandro Milici","Done and renewed. Signing the contract. ","2026-01-08T08:40:31.446Z"],["3794651","DRX-27977","DRX","hardi.hansson@bolt.eu","Hardi Hansson","✅ Tested on DA.126.0 (1502) Firebase build on Samsung A12, OS:13\n\n\n!Recording_20260108_103756.mp4|width=320,alt=\"Recording_20260108_103756.mp4\"!","2026-01-08T08:40:47.142Z"],["3794657","DSR-3123","DSR","priit.lehis@bolt.eu","Priit Lehis","Response sent out. ","2026-01-08T08:42:32.263Z"],["3794658","INSUR-175","INSUR","alessandro@bolt.eu","Alessandro Milici","Currently collecting information for renewal and contacting our partners to see who can offer a solution ","2026-01-08T08:43:08.234Z"],["3794660","DPLC-620","DPLC","kostiantyn.tsykulenko@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Tsykulenko","[https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/7176093750/SQL+DWHs+for+Looker+Optimisation|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DATA/pages/7176093750/SQL+DWHs+for+Looker+Optimisation|smart-link]  design doc","2026-01-08T08:43:13.830Z"],["3794661","FX-3574","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*FleetX reports [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1767861785038669]*{color}:\nIssue FX-3574 successfully transitioned to state 'Done'.\n{quote}","2026-01-08T08:43:17.676Z"],["3794662","L10N-26403","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26401](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26401)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-08T08:43:20.187Z"],["3794663","L10N-26405","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that: