to:\n\n* Have access to the tickets url Tier 1 to Safety\n* Have access to tickets url Safety to Tier 1\n\n","2026-01-08T13:41:25.153Z"],["3796250","LSS-53508","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","The address of Bolt office where the agreement should be sent to:\n\n_If it arrives within the next week then please send this to_ [~accountid:622f787a1f014e0069cc0d85]  _to Tallinn office or if not possible to arrange it that soon then please send it to_ [_@aleksandra.tretiak_|https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/team/U09P6JV457D]_-s name._\n\n_Kirsika Liiva_\n*_Bolt Operations OÜ_*\n*_Vana-Lõuna 15, Tallinn 10134, Estonia_*\n[_+372 56983090_|tel:+37256983090]","2026-01-08T13:41:54.923Z"],["3796256","WFM-9895","WFM","jana.mariakova@bolt.eu","Jana Marjakova-Līdeka","Hello [~accountid:712020:3a3742eb-3298-4df7-a8af-c0fd7279bf95], \r\n\r\nQueues added manually. Let me know if there are any issues.\r\n\r\nHave a good day!","2026-01-08T13:42:51.697Z"],["3796257","C3HW-98","C3HW","endrik.salak@bolt.eu","Endrik Salak","Release for IOTC-2-R02, IOTC-3-R02, IOTC-4-R02: [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15ZM8CoLsQMwgPKNtrWOdt5O2Dv5tNXgR?usp=drive_link|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15ZM8CoLsQMwgPKNtrWOdt5O2Dv5tNXgR?usp=drive_link|smart-link] ","2026-01-08T13:43:05.350Z"],["3796259","L10N-26509","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-08T13:43:26.992Z"],["3796260","L10N-26517","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-08T13:43:27.074Z"],["3796261","L10N-26525","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-08T13:43:27.088Z"],["3796262","L10N-26522","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-08T13:43:27.113Z"],["3796263","L10N-26513","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-08T13:43:27.114Z"],["3796264","L10N-26526","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-