orating!","2026-01-08T14:43:38.110Z"],["3796623","SUPX-2308","SUPX","artem.kudlaienko@bolt.eu","Artem Kudlaienko","Yes, this should work. The preferable approach would be to apply the self-serve flow before/instead of running AI if a supported flow exists.\nCurrently, the logic that applies a flow to a support case lives in {{SupportCaseFlowSolutionRunner.ts}}, so we would likely need an endpoint in customer_support that can be invoked from the automation side.","2026-01-08T14:45:11.943Z"],["3796624","SUPX-2308","SUPX",null,"Slack","[Artem Kudlaienko|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/630e0b9a9796033b256bd3a5] synced this conversation thread with the Slack thread [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C064FCFAT0S/p1767860854118209?thread_ts=1767366357.447089&cid=C064FCFAT0S|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C064FCFAT0S/p1767860854118209?thread_ts=1767366357.447089&cid=C064FCFAT0S|smart-link]. Replies in synced threads will automatically update across both Slack and Jira.","2026-01-08T14:45:13.132Z"],["3796626","LSS-59920","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:712020:88708ab5-cc12-4cc3-8ce6-ade32a312d44] did you get the letter from the Partner?","2026-01-08T14:45:37.013Z"],["3796629","LSS-61233","LSS","thomas.harper@bolt.eu","Thomas Harper","+*UPDATE (08.01)*+\n\n* Test will be launched on either 14 or 15 January. \n* Test will last 4 weeks. Rollout of the final feature would be decided based on the results.","2026-01-08T14:45:46.608Z"],["3796630","LSS-59847","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:712020:88708ab5-cc12-4cc3-8ce6-ade32a312d44] did you get the letter from the Partner?","2026-01-08T14:45:58.887Z"],["3796631","PFI-814802","PFI","mariia.dubrova@bolt-outsource.eu","Mariia Dubrova","Hello, are there any updates?","2026-01-08T14:46:18.290Z"],["3796633","WD-22522","WD","barbara.puss@bolt.eu","Barbara Püss","Dear [~accountid:712020:4c80c500-8466-444d-b13e-b2984ef3723c] , issue is fixed. I have an access now. 🙂 ","2026-01-08T14:46:44.774Z"],["3796635","LSS-56967","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:712020:853cbe25-4d18-40c3-8211-69c3936bf72f] ! any update here or we can close this ticket for now?","2026-01-08T14:46:59.674Z"],["3796636","RDS-1397","RDS","julia.mitzinneck@bolt.eu","Julia Mitzinneck","[~accountid:6358f09ab0b6ef03564955ba] I think no, cause NDP risk. Only re-match when driver with same or lower ETA available. wdyt?","2026-01-08T14:47:18.428Z"],["3796637","LSS-56861","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:5b8d306bfa38ae2c89608b95] as the ticket is old and seems to be resolved from the legal side I am closing the ticket for now (ready to be reopen any time). ","2026-01-08T14:48:03.060Z"],["3796639","PFI-830745","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nPaystack has just confirmed the refund has been issued to the customer. The user should receive it within 72 hours. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-08T14:49:08.936Z"],["3796641","LSS-57018","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:5b8d306bfa38ae2c89608b95] ! as the ticket is old and seems to be resolved from the legal pov, I am closing the ticket for now (ready to be reopened any time).","2026-01-08T14:49:42.583Z"],["3796642","LSS-61157","LSS","viktoriia.voskolup@bolt.eu","Viktoriia Voskolup","[~accountid:712020:10c3f4ef-f975-47a3-8af8-927b01cd9521] will we sign for the trial any order form ? \n\nWe need also to add the wording about compliance with Bolt’s InfoSec Code [https://bolt.eu/en/security/supplier-requirements/|https://bolt.eu/en/security/supplier-requirements/|smart-link]. “The Parties will comply with Customer’s Information Security Code of Practice [https://bolt.eu/en/security/supplier-requirements/|https://bolt.eu/en/security/supplier-requirements/|smart-link] in the course of providing the services”.  \n\nPlease share the link with partner and ask to review. \n\n ","2026-01-08T14:49:50.666Z"],["3796643","PFI-830479","PFI","karan.gaikwad@bolt.eu","Karan Rajesh Gaikwad","I have raised this to the bank i am unable to trace this payment !","2026-01-08T14:50:16.732Z"],["3796645","LSS-55903","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, as the ticket is old and seems to be held on due to PR/marketing issues I am closing this ticket for now (ready to be reopened any time).","2026-01-08T14:50:51.392Z"],["3796647","LSS-55276","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:712020:ed417274-8cb0-4891-8fc6-bdf737cb3acb] ! any updates here or I can close the ticket for now?","2026-01-08T14:51:36.391Z"],["3796651","LSS-53093","LSS","jolanta.prystupa@bolt.eu","Jolanta Prystupa","hi, [~accountid:63d0eccfa197e05f9dadc837] any update here or I can close this ticket for now?","2026-01-08T14:52:49.538Z"],["3796653","PFI-830425","PFI","karan.gaikwad@bolt.eu","Karan Rajesh Gaikwad","Hey please provide company id !","2026-01-08T14:53:24.220Z"],["3796654","LSS-55043","LSS","raivis.busmanis@bolt.eu","Raivis Bušmanis","Hi [~accountid:712020:5e3bcefc-e2ed-4de9-8197-663f375263bd] , correct.","2026-01-08T14:53:30.866Z"],["3796656","LSS-60149","LSS","edik.davtian@bolt.eu","Edik Davtian","Hi [~accountid:712020:663f2145-dfc6-459e-9619-14aca983f77c] ,\n\nThanks for your quick response.\n\n* Aligned that it is not Bolt’s responsibility & we cannot measure or impact\n* We would need first to pay to receive this certificate from the supplier following “Temperature monitoring as a legal requirement arising from Regulation (EC) No 852/2004 and the HACCP framework.” Currently we do not have a document\n* I checked it from the practical side with our Courier OPS - and there is no centralised process in general, apart from Latvia.\n* Therefore, I would assume - we do the EU-certified certificate & hope for the best - just to not block this cooperation. Aligned?\n!Screenshot 2026-01-07 at 09.57.27.png|width=623,height=223,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-07 at 09.57.27.png\"!\n\n","2026-01-08T14:54:07.444Z"],["3796657","PAR-3841","PAR","ahmed.farghaly@bolt.eu","Ahmed Farghaly","Yes, this is the correct table","2026-01-08T14:54:28.238Z"],["3796660","PAR-3841","PAR","alexander.fokau@bolt.eu","Alexander Fokau","I checked the driver [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/fleet/drivers/edit/8249003|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/fleet/drivers/edit/8249003]\nmentioned above by [@saiful.islam|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/60528926695c3900706cc79e]\n\n*According to data in Spark:*\n\n{{client}} row was created 2025-11-19 18:26:42 (UTC)\nIt is exactly the same second when driver account was created.\n\nSo it is not fully correct assumption\n\n{quote}We should have received a webhook notification when this Flex account was created, but it seems that didn’t happen. As a result, the account is missing in our system, which is why early cashout cannot be created{quote}\n\ncan you please keep investigation [@ahmed.farghaly|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/people/63fc5f040a4a47fb8d20cf92]","2026-01-08T14:54:56.894Z"],["3796661","PFI-831049","PFI","oluwaferanmi.arogundade@bolt-outsource.eu","Oluwaferanmi Arogundade","!Screenshot_20260108_154308_Capitec.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-08T14:55:05.754Z"],["3796663","LSS-54001","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hey [~accountid:628e5c9d8026a10068b1e457] - What’s the status regarding these?","2026-01-08T14:55:33.893Z"],["3796664","LSS-61293","LSS","raivis.busmanis@bolt.eu","Raivis Bušmanis","Hi colleagues, please be informed that counterparty will initiate signing via DocuSign and address it to Ahto and [+signing@bolt.eu+|mailto:signing@bolt.eu] in cc.","2026-01-08T14:55:35.220Z"],["3796665","PAR-3841","PAR","alexander.fokau@bolt.eu","Alexander Fokau","*Attachments*\n\n* [https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A7H45VBV4/screenshot_2026-01-08_at_16.55.50.png|https://bolt.enterprise.slack.com/files/U786847FW/F0A7H45VBV4/screenshot_2026-01-08_at_16.55.50.png|smart-link]","2026-01-08T14:56:03.497Z"],["3796667","DSR-3591","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-08T14:56:41.161Z"],["3796669","LSS-57706","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi! Please find the signed document from our side attached since partner hasn’t still signed. You may forward this to them via email if they find it easier to sign that way. Ticket will be closed. If they decide to sign, kindly forward the duly signed version to [contracts@bolt.eu|mailto:contracts@bolt.eu] with a ticket number. Thanks!\n\n[^2025.10.22. NEKUSTAMĀ ĪPAŠUMA NOMAS LĪGUMS Bolt Services LV_A2_31Z_2025.edoc]\n\n","2026-01-08T14:57:41.082Z"],["3796670","L10N-26684","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent E