"PFI-831198","PFI","chargeback_reports@bolt.eu","chargeback_reports","\n\n[^M2309128.TXT] _(0.9 kB)_","2026-01-09T04:01:20.289Z"],["3797089","PFI-831200","PFI","augustina.oweh@bolt-outsource.eu","Augustina Oweh","!Sam.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-09T04:32:04.038Z"],["3797103","FDBT-4753","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-09T05:10:09.292Z"],["3797104","FDBT-4752","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-09T05:10:16.283Z"],["3797106","DSR-3599","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-09T05:21:06.275Z"],["3797108","LSS-61217","LSS","mo.salama@bolt.eu","Mo Salama","Hi Aleksandra,\n\n \n\nPlease note that the House Tax Registration Number is assigned to the physical office space itself, regardless of whether the company owns or leases the property.\n\n \n\nSince Bolt Taiwan has changed its address, we should have the latest Application for registration of the establishment (alteration) of the Withholding Agency(扣繳單位設立(變更)登記申請書), which include house tax registration number.\n\nPlease find the below picture for your reference\n\n!image001.jpg|width=957,height=445,alt=\"image001.jpg\"!\n\n","2026-01-09T05:31:32.268Z"],["3797141","DSR-3603","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-09T06:01:37.918Z"],["3797142","DSR-3601","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-09T06:01:38.030Z"],["3797143","PFI-831219","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋 \nThanks for the ticket! While we get to your request, please make sure to check Configuration Requests Guide (https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/x/sQUQDAE) to see if you have added everything we need to the ticket, in order to make the process faster and more convenient! \n\nPlease note that, in this queue, we are handling requests related to fee calculators, base fee calculators, invoice issuers, commission changes, invoice layout changes.. etc.\n\nThank you! ","2026-01-09T06:06:06.509Z"],["3797144","PFI-831219","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋 \nThank you for submitting a ticket to Billing! Looks like this ticket needs approval - [~accountId:61261fa2dd25520076a72c06] please approve this ticket in order to continue.\n\nCheers\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-09T06:06:08.743Z"],["3797146","PFI-814395","PFI","inese.cerina@bolt.eu","Inese Ceriņa","Hey, could we please get an update?","2026-01-09T06:07:10.408Z"],["3797148","PFI-830850","PFI","seema.matli@bolt.eu","Seema Matli","Hi there.. the issue is not yet resolved because the payment has still not been allocated. Please advise here, thank..","2026-01-09T06:12:22.291Z"],["3797151","HS-28745","HS","razvan.nastase@bolt.eu","Răzvan Năstase","Hello! Can I please get some help with this? This is currently blocking renewing my expired driving license. ","2026-01-09T06:17:13.537Z"],["3797152","PFI-830850","PFI","seema.matli@bolt.eu","Seema Matli","[~accountid:712020:1a99e337-a650-4a85-a8ed-f0825a04e850] Could you have a look at this please 🙏🏾","2026-01-09T06:20:10.807Z"],["3797153","PAW-14746","PAW","token.atlassianpint@bolt.eu","Token Atlassian PINT","🤖 Auto-closed: PR was approved by @BoltCristianLupu\n\nPR: https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/160184\nStatus: open\nAuto-closed at: 2026-01-09 06:24:46 UTC\n\nIf this ticket was closed incorrectly, you can reopen it manually.","2026-01-09T06:24:47.126Z"],["3797157","EBIKE1-396","EBIKE1","martin.petrov@bolt.eu","Martin Petrov","Rear mudguard Test-1\n\n*Conclusion:* If the rear mudguard aligns with the tire, it minimizes water drops on the mudguard.\n\nFor more accurate results, testing while riding in wet conditions is essential.\n\nNext:\n\n# create 3D printed flaps and observe the differences.\n# To conduct a test while the rear mudguard is misaligned with the tire, as shown below.\n\n{adf:display=block}\n{\"type\":\"table\",\"attrs\":{\"isNumberColumnEnabled\":false,\"layout\":\"align-start\",\"localId\":\"b9f7e346-c80d-4b34-874e-a534ad72036f\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableRow\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{\"colspan\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mudguard misaligned with the tire\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strong\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Result\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strong\"}]}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableRow\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":454,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"57873c7fbeb0816210c67cc7f2098fb5-20260109-065051.jpg\",\"alt\":\"57873c7fbeb0816210c67cc7f2098fb5-20260109-065051.jpg\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":567,\"width\":567}}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":446,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"d192b775d90cb80abc161ff67eeeada4-20260109-065124.jpg\",\"alt\":\"d192b775d90cb80abc161ff67eeeada4-20260109-065124.jpg\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":567,\"width\":567}}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}]}]}\n{adf}\n\n{adf:display=block}\n{\"type\":\"table\",\"attrs\":{\"isNumberColumnEnabled\":false,\"layout\":\"align-start\",\"localId\":\"8c349164-ef1a-4d8c-aa2d-1087b9daaaf7\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableRow\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mudguard aligned precisely with the tire\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strong\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{\"colspan\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Test\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strong\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{\"colspan\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Result\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strong\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"There are minimal amount of water drops on the mudguard\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableRow\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":301,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"1977badb7e3cf613e260f4bd7a1b3cb5-20260109-063054.jpg\",\"alt\":\"1977badb7e3cf613e260f4bd7a1b3cb5-20260109-063054.jpg\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":567,\"width\":567}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":320,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"cbfca0a64170447854529c8ae05f29ea.mp4\",\"alt\":\"cbfca0a64170447854529c8ae05f29ea.mp4\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":1280,\"width\":720}}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":320,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"b3bdf31e48b46de046802f8c3491227c.mp4\",\"alt\":\"b3bdf31e48b46de046802f8c3491227c.mp4\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":1280,\"width\":720}}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":226,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"f9aff6064e5dc51120c9adf8a2c7cd8e-20260109-063144.jpg\",\"alt\":\"f9aff6064e5dc51120c9adf8a2c7cd8e-20260109-063144.jpg\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":567,\"width\":567}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":226,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"e192540c166027334ade31bac93d27a2-20260109-063153.jpg\",\"alt\":\"e192540c166027334ade31bac93d27a2-20260109-063153.jpg\",\"collection\":\"\",\"height\":567,\"width\":567}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}]}]}\n{adf}\n\n*Front mudguard test*\n\n*Conclusion:* Other mudguards perform similarly. When steering right or left, legs can get wet, which can happen with any bike, including Ampler, as reported by Juho Laurits.\n\nA rubber flap may help, but it is not a guaranteed solution, and legs will still get wet.\n\nFor the next step, create 3D printed flaps and observe the differences.\n\n|| || ||\n|!4a24ab3bdaf0daeb4421e3a9efbd6286.mp4|width=468,alt=\"4a24ab3bdaf0daeb4421e3a9efbd6286.mp4\"!|!55c1d8f52563b9561795f4ab02651017-20260109-063846.jpg|width=468,alt=\"55c1d8f52563b9561795f4ab02651017-20260109-063846.jpg\"!|","2026-01-09T06:39:15.148Z"],["3797163","WFM-9912","WFM","jerry.fadhili@bolt-outsource.eu","Jerry Fadhili","Please ignore the above request","2026-01-09T06:42:52.322Z"],["3797167","LSS-61303","LSS","kristjan.okas@bolt.eu","Kristjan Okas","Hey!\n[~accountid:622f787a1f014e0069cc0d85] , we can add a digital signature to this document, correct?","2026-01-09T06:45:46.001Z"],["3797169","WFM-9913","WFM","jerry.fadhili@bolt-outsource.eu","Jerry Fadhili","Please ignore the above request","2026-01-09T06:46:53.841Z"],["3797170","WD-22517","WD","peggy.dano@bolt.eu","Peggy Stefany Dano","Hi Dominika, \n\nWe hope that this file is visible to these employee by 16th of January 2026. We will publish the second P9 file covering period 202506-202512 in February/March 2026. ","2026-01-09T06:47:17.545Z"],["3797172","FDBT-4705","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_data_integr