12020:910c9a84-3532-4a39-97d2-4aee154ce8df] for your review. Driver all data + suspension request. Driver suspension reason: [offering off-platform journeys|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/699622188]. Final block decision - maintained. \n\n* Redacted driver, rider ticket [here|https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/18FCAoC4NsjET5iOcudiFM8tEAo1MMZYk] \n* Response ticket prepared [here|https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/18FCAoC4NsjET5iOcudiFM8tEAo1MMZYk]\n* All personal data prepared [here|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15I_tlKrlZL0n76s5_B0d5Vn1APxpknuk?usp=drive_link]","2026-01-09T07:02:24.777Z"],["3797261","EBIKE1-379","EBIKE1","sander.viitak@bolt.eu","Sander Viitak","Will finish drawings and BOM updates {{2026-01-09}} \nTwo drawings to make, others which are done I added to EB1 BOM, can be checked from there. [~accountid:6130627ef0bf520069526076] ","2026-01-09T07:04:21.297Z"],["3797264","PFI-830876","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! Billing does not handle payments. Based on which information did you decide to create the ticket to Billing? Maybe there’s some information incorrect 🙂 ","2026-01-09T07:04:33.397Z"],["3797265","PFI-830832","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-09T07:05:33.583Z"],["3797268","G3IOT-1174","G3IOT","mikhail.urbant@bolt.eu","Mikhail Urbant","Wi-Fi functionality is ready, working on IRAM optimizations, considering to use Nimble host to save IRAM and DRAM","2026-01-09T07:07:37.572Z"],["3797271","PFI-829951","PFI","support@flitt.com","support@flitt.com","გამარჯობა,\n\nგთხოვთ მოგვწეროთ, რით შეგვიძლია დაგეხმაროთ?\n\nპატივისცემით,\n\nNino Pachulia\n\n{color:#1d1c1d}Support Specialist{color}\n\n\n\n{color:#222222}+995 325 00 01 02{color}\n\n[npachulia@flitt.com|mailto:npachulia@flitt.com] | [LinkedIn|https://www.linkedin.com/in/nino-pachulia/] | [www.flitt.com|https://flitt.com/]{color:#202124}{color}{color:#202124}{color}\n\n\n\n\n!https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdesUJg1p54UqXLenrFQFanpvXuj_umTqEFnw1W5JR9LBf8O3m6bGImWLGpg2ulKBMgaF3p6b25v6bmXHIHIZutpHE-jvRov39TlA4JBIsOA1TnvQv9Hi1Pl6DSaGos3E_cDDVNa_WgN0NWjc5AHd9dzQAW?key=gAVmix1twk-tFXoz-xQXqA!{color:#202124}{color}\n\n\n---- on Thu, 08 Jan 2026 10:17:39 +0400  *\"pfi\"<pfi@taxify.atlassian.net>*  wrote ---- \n\n\n{quote}\n\n\n\n{color:#333333}{color}{color:#999999} —-—-—-—{color} {color:#333333}\n{color}{color:#999999} Reply above this line.{color} {color:#333333}\n\n\nchargeback_reports commented:\n\nსალამი, გთხოვთ უკუკავშირს.\n\nSincerely,\n\n________________________________________\n\nთეკლე გოი/ Tekle goi\n\nCard Manager\n\nCustomer Support Department\n\nTel: +(995 32) 2 27 27 27{color}\n\n[{color:#333333}{color}{color:#0563C1}www.tbcbank.ge{color}{color:#333333}{color}|http://www.tbcbank.ge]{color:#333333}{color}\n\n{color:#333333}{color} !1767942492548013_292097426.png|thumbnail!{color:#333333}  <[https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/request/2972373/attachment/1103910]>{color}\n\n[{color:#333333}{color}{color:#3572b0}View request{color}|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/PFI-829951?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ0Z3QiOiJhbm9ueW1vdXMtbGluayIsInFzaCI6IjJkOGQxMmYwNGQ0ODVkNGYyMGVhMTA3ZjFjNjI2NjEzYWFjMTA5YmY0YmQwZmYzZTRhMzQzYjlkM2NmNWY2ZTciLCJpc3MiOiJzZXJ2aWNlZGVzay1qd3QtdG9rZW4taXNzdWVyIiwiY29udGV4dCI6eyJ1c2VyIjoiNTM4MDYiLCJpc3N1ZSI6IlBGSS04Mjk5NTEifSwiZXhwIjoxNzcwMjcyMjU4LCJpYXQiOjE3Njc4NTMwNTh9.Pil6_SYqpLiKbwUT90JHTgae3WaTnfWGQ2ALJU_E1ac&sda_source=notification-email]{color:#3572b0}{color}{color:#333333} ·{color} [{color:#333333}{color}{color:#3572b0}Turn off this request's notifications{color}|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/PFI-829951/unsubscribe?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..oMDCBCu-CYVqehlaF0irAxKWmMdQqj2nNHquF9o4yhI]{color:#3572b0}{color}{color:#333333}\n\n{color}{color:#707070}This is shared with chargeback_reports and{color} [{color:#707070}support@flitt.com{color}|mailto:support@flitt.com]{color:#707070}.{color}{color:#333333}{color}\n\n[{color:#333333}{color}{color:#707070}Powered by Jira Service Management{color}|https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira/service-desk/powered-by?utm_medium=jira-in-product&utm_source=jira_service_desk_email_footer&utm_content=taxify]{color:#707070}{color}{color:#333333}\n Sent on January 8, 2026 8:17:38 AM EET{color} \n!http://use1-track.atlassian.com/CI0/0100019b9c40ef82-6c3c4a73-1cdc-4e96-9687-e6f1dd971b79-000000/Be4bgDNTmALgxgyPFFg7NwH5YXnxCn6X83xsGFwzES8=439!{color:#333333}{color} \n{quote}","2026-01-09T07:08:21.590Z"],["3797272","G3IOT-701","G3IOT","mikhail.urbant@bolt.eu","Mikhail Urbant","Quectel has prepared the official release supporting BIP switch. Waiting for DFOTA files","2026-01-09T07:08:38.891Z"],["3797274","PFI-829664","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","They should be able to access the courier → eater invoices from the app. For food invoices, we can’t issue those on behalf of providers, so the eater needs to contact the restaurant for that 🙂 ","2026-01-09T07:09:10.967Z"],["3797275","PFI-826560","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Hi! Yes, that’s correct! ","2026-01-09T07:09:52.593Z"],["3797278","PFI-830929","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed; value date 2025-11-10. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; for the request to add VAT to the payout amount, please create a Service Desk ticket for the Billing team, as payout amounts are calculated by Billing.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-09T07:11:56.717Z"],["3797279","DSR-3241","DSR","priit.lehis@bolt.eu","Priit Lehis","[~accountid:712020:910c9a84-3532-4a39-97d2-4aee154ce8df] for your review. Driver all data + suspension request. Driver suspension reason: [driver not the same as in app|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/case/706600008]. Final block decision - maintained.\n\n* Redacted driver, rider ticket [here|https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/127JoIX4rc3bj8TfizE4y56Dh-A7Ruf11]\n* Response ticket prepared [here|https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/127JoIX4rc3bj8TfizE4y56Dh-A7Ruf11]\n* All personal data [here|https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19BgQVk8I2i4Op5zmBmyPJDMCarREX6Ov?usp=drive_link]","2026-01-09T07:12:03.609Z"],["3797281","PFI-830964","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout was rejected because the bank could not process some characters in the partner’s payout details (e.g., non‑Latin letters, emojis, or special symbols in the beneficiary name/address or payment reference). Please ask the partner to update their payout profile to use standard Latin letters and numbers only and ensure the account/IBAN is correct; once fixed, the payout will be reprocessed in the next regular cycle (or they can try Early Cashout again). If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-09T07:12:16.930Z"],["3797282","PFI-830969","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout has been pending since 22 Dec and is taking longer than usual. This often happens due to an ongoing compliance review or technical issues on the payment provider’s side. The Partner Payments team is monitoring these pending payouts and responds to any compliance checks immediately; no action is required from the partner right now. Please inform the partner that we will proceed as soon as it is cleared and the funds will arrive once processing completes.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-09T07:12:49.753Z"],["3797283","PFI-830978","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout was rejected by the payment provider, and they did not provide an exact reason. Please inform the partner it will be automatically reprocessed in the next regular payout cycle; if this was an Early Cashout, they can submit the cashout request again. P.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase; feedback is welcome.","2026-01-09T07:13:19.002Z"],["3797285","PFI-831084","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This Early Cashout is currently pending with Bank of Georgia (status: Sending to Bank of Georgia) and is being processed. The last update was on 2026-01-06, which is within the usual 1–2 business day window; it should appear on the partner’s bank account shortly. If it remains pending beyond 2–3 business days, it may be due to a compliance review or temporary provider-side issues; we are monitoring and will respond to any checks immediately. If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-09T07:14:00.898Z"],["3797286","PFI-830852","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still in pending state since 2026-01-05, which indicates a delay likely due to an ongoing compliance review or a technical issue on the payment provider’s side. We are monitoring pending payouts and respond to any provider requests as soon as they arrive; no action is required from the partner at this moment. If the partner receives the funds before the app updates, the status will refresh on the next business day.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-09T07:14:28.235Z"],["3797287","DELIVERY-1056","DELIVERY","jevgeni.geimanen@bolt.eu","Jevgeni Geimanen","Thanks to [~accountid:712020:2652e278-1ca2-45de-bffa-0ac4c14e1c7e] 's reaction to my [post in Slack|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C019LG81F7V/p1757058710681989?thread_ts=1754291585.896569&cid=C019LG81F7V], I got reminded we have some raised concerns not being addressed. Quoting my message:\n\nWhile I agree with the calculation of €50k saved costs for CS, I would like to raise some challenging points\n\n# What would be the “large enough” number in this case? As per my calculations, this number is equal (ROI:1) to 16 ENG weeks\n# Total impact of this feature is hybrid. One part of it indeed comes from saving CS cost, but is it correct to neglect the impact from delayed orders, and courier under-utilisation? This part was not analysed.\n\ncc [~accountid:6268ef941a4eb30069d0a75c] , needs your input 🙏 ","2026-01-09T07:14:46.494Z"],["3797288","WFM-9886","WFM","jana.mariakova@bolt.eu","Jana Marjakova-Līdeka","Hey [~accountid:712020:d706766d-8b50-4da6-9056-6d3a20ccaddb], \n\nThey will again lose access. It seems that the issue is that they have queues under their profile in Admin. Why though? Can I unassign queues as they are a manager and are not actively working on tickets? ","2026-01-09T07:14:48.561Z"],["3797289","PFI-831010","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout is still in Pending status with the last update on 2026-01-05; since that’s longer than usual, the delay is likely due to an ongoing compliance review or a temporary issue on the payment provider’s side. Please inform the courier that the payout is being processed; our team monitors pending payouts and responds to any compliance checks promptly—no action is required from their side. The funds will be credited once cleared and the status in the app will update automatically.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-09T07:14:58.773Z"],["3797290","PFI-831239","PFI","oluwaferanmi.arogundade@bolt-outsource.eu","Oluwaferanmi Arogundade","!JPEG_1767942404194_1071457852289313731.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-09T07:15:02.803Z"],["3797291","PFI-830769","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nUnfortunately, I’m not able to find the payment based on this information. \nTo locate it we would need some additional information. The payment descriptor would be very helpful. ","2026-01-09T07:15:33.908Z"],["3797292","DSR-3571","DSR","sigrid.hobejarv@bolt.eu","Sigrid Hõbejärv","Added to the folder :done: \nBeehive calls\nAll data download without communications plugins\nRider invoices\nWaiting for communications plugin to be fixed :loading: ","2026-01-09T07:15:51.137Z"],["3797293","LSS-59913","LSS","alon.alkalay@bolt.eu","Alon Alkalay","Hey [~accountid:712020:0c8dd65b-46d5-4dc0-b5bd-76209c1e8048] - I see you assigned this one back to me. Is there a reason you won’t be driving this AI Tool review any longer? ","2026-01-09T07:16:00.888Z"],["3797298","HS-28772","HS","aikemaris.muursepp@bolt.eu","Aike-Maris Müürsepp","No sick leave in [eesti.ee|http://eesti.ee] yet.","2026-01-09T07:17:45.397Z"],["3797300","CSDT-939","CSDT","boris.pavlov@bolt.eu","Boris Pavlov","Forecast accuracy completed, waiting for actual cost","2026-01-09T07:18:04.276Z"],["3797315","PC-4078","PC","kevin.kanarbik@bolt.eu","Kevin Kanarbik","Sadly my theory that updated dependencies will solve the issue was wrong, [there are still “Loading CSS chunk” issues in PaymentsWeb|https://kibana-logs.elasticsearch.boltint.net/app/r/s/9BAFK]\nNeed to try another solution.","2026-01-09T07:23:45.039Z"],["3797316","PFI-831244","PFI","oluwaferanmi.arogundade@bolt-outsource.eu","Oluwaferanmi Arogundade","!20251229_145901.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-09T07:23:46.814Z"],["3797320","LSS-61206","LSS","alon.alkalay@bolt.eu","Alon Alkalay","Thanks [~accountid:712020:6f095333-c438-429c-9660-a9de5d845fe7] - I’m fine with the data being stored together. My question is: where is that storage location? Admin? A separate data lake? A spreadsheet? Thanks!","2026-01-09T07:26:01.453Z"],["3797322","CSXDL-109","CSXDL","kristiina.himma@bolt.eu","Kristiina Himma","Closing this topic, as the task itself got done. ","2026-01-09T07:27:15.902Z"],["3797327","HS-28751","HS","kristi.vahl@bolt.eu","Kristi Liina Vahl","With global mobility.","2026-01-09T07:28:56.382Z"],["3797329","PFI-830974","PFI","marten.martinson@bolt.eu","Marten Martinson","Hi team, \n\nThe payment is here\n\n\n!image-20260109-072814.png|width=1026,height=184!\n\nPlease note the user had 2 payments from the 11th of December. \n\n[https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/3934987169|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/3934987169] 55 ZAR.\n[https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/3935030532|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/commerce-payment/payments/3935030532] 112 ZAR - 57 ZAR refund = 55 ZAR. \n\nIt looks like the users bank has already deducted the refund amount from the original payment. \n\nEverything looks good. \n\nCheers, \nMarten","2026-01-09T07:29:41.943Z"],["3797330","PFI-830966","PFI","cecilia.muthui@bolt-outsource.eu","Cecilia Muthui","Hi team,\n\nI have tried reissuing the refund, but the refund action is not available. \n\nCecilia","2026-01-09T07:30:20.518Z"],["3797331","HS-28346","HS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi [~accountId:712020:e1427b30-bc75-43cd-9e45-85c863998272],\n\nThere haven't been any updates to the ticket for *10 days*. Please review this ticket and take the necessary action:\n\n*Update*: If the issue is still ongoing, please provide an update on the current status\n\n*Close Complete*: If the issue has been resolved, please close the ticket.\n\n*Close Incomplete*: If the issue is no longer relevant or has been determined not to be actionable, please add a comment and move it to status close incomplete.","2026-01-09T07:31:08.532Z"],["3797332","HS-28348","HS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi [~accountId:712020:e1427b30-bc75-43cd-9e45-85c863998272],\n\nThere haven't been any updates to the ticket for *10 days*. Please review this ticket and take the necessary action:\n\n*Update*: If the issue is still ongoing, please provide an update on the current status\n\n*Close Complete*: If the issue has been resolved, please close the ticket.\n\n*Close Incomplete*: If the issue is no longer relevant or has been determined not to be actionable, please add a comment and move it to status close incomplete.","2026-01-09T07:31:08.544Z"],["3797333","HS-28266","HS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi [~accountId:712020:9d22087b-9bd3-42c9-944c-2112fcfa004e],\n\nThere haven't been any updates to the ticket for *10 days*. Please review this ticket and take the necessary action:\n\n*Update*: If the issue is still ongoing, please provide an update on the current status\n\n*Close Complete*: If the issue has been resolved, please close the ticket.\n\n*Close Incomplete*: If the issue is no longer relevant or has been determined not to be actionable, please add a comment and move it to status close incomplete.","2026-01-09T07:31:08.662Z"],["3797334","HS-28398","HS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi [~accountId:712020:b794ab88-0428-44ea-9340-6e