ntext, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26881](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26881)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-09T10:28:35.020Z"],["3798302","FPD-1181","FPD","andrei.kuchev@bolt.eu","Andrei Kuchev","Moved to [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FPD-1381|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FPD-1381|smart-link] ","2026-01-09T10:28:35.226Z"],["3798305","LSS-60701","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi [~accountid:61ae0932c510bc006b3d29cd] - Partner’s signature is still missing. Kindly follow up with them regarding this. Reminder has been sent from our side. Thanks!\n\nAttaching here the version with our signature already as well since I will be leaving next week and to ensure that nothing goes missing. If it’s easier they can sign this version instead as well. If they do so kindly ensure to share the duly signed version with us as well.\n\n[^ANNEX 2 to LT251043-LT251060_AT agreement.adoc]  ","2026-01-09T10:30:01.498Z"],["3798308","DSR-2285","DSR","estelle.herbiet@bolt.eu","Estelle Herbiet","Hi [~accountid:712020:8fd75aa8-dcfb-42ad-93ab-53900ee4c301] , could you please advise on how to proceed on this ticket? We would be grateful on your guidance as to the approach concerning the lawyer’s question - this is outside of Privacy’s scope and requires Regional Legal input.\n\nThanks in advance!","2026-01-09T10:30:28.759Z"],["3798310","WFM-9917","WFM","ruxandra.dumitrescu@bolt.eu","Ruxandra-Elena Dumitrescu","Hello! Agents were added to the queue; Wish you a great day!","2026-01-09T10:30:51.579Z"],["3798311","LSS-60361","LSS","ben.strey@bolt.eu","Ben Strey","[~accountid:622f787a1f014e0069cc0d85] please do not close the ticket. We might need to adjust the contract but are currently negotiating this with the partner","2026-01-09T10:31:15.789Z"],["3798313","PFI-831273","PFI","marten.koger@bolt.eu","Marten Koger","Hello [~accountid:712020:43b3d197-c0f3-4c6c-bc13-8f952703b35f],\n\nThank you for escalating this.\nI can confirm that these were indeed related and that the user is fraudulent.\nAll 3 profiles have now been fraud-blocked, meaning that all further accounts will be affected by our fraud engine, restricting their access on our platform.\n\nBest,\nMarten","2026-01-09T10:31:41.014Z"],["3798314","LSS-60997","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","SD: [https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/337781?blocked=true&returnTo=%2Fcontracts%2Fv2%3FCONTRACTSV3_SEARCH%3DeyJxdWVyeSI6W3siZmllbGROYW1lIjoicXVlcnkiLCJ2YWx1ZSI6IlN3YW5zIENsb3NldCwgVW5pcGVzc29hbCwgTGRhIiwib3BlcmF0b3IiOiJlcSJ9XX0%253D%26clusterId%3DEU%26workspaceId%3D31839&clusterId=EU&workspaceId=31839|https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/337781?blocked=true&returnTo=%2Fcontracts%2Fv2%3FCONTRACTSV3_SEARCH%3DeyJxdWVyeSI6W3siZmllbGROYW1lIjoicXVlcnkiLCJ2YWx1ZSI6IlN3YW5zIENsb3NldCwgVW5pcGVzc29hbCwgTGRhIiwib3BlcmF0b3IiOiJlcSJ9XX0%253D%26clusterId%3DEU%26workspaceId%3D31839&clusterId=EU&workspaceId=31839|smart-link] ","2026-01-09T10:32:03.129Z"],["3798315","LSS-60997","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hey [~accountid:712020:705c56b5-c931-428e-8282-8c20af89d9c2] - Please follow up with the partner as their signature is still missing from the document. Thanks!","2026-01-09T10:32:22.099Z"],["3798316","LSS-60999","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Hi [~accountid:712020:705c56b5-c931-428e-8282-8c20af89d9c2] - Please follow up with the partner as their signature is still missing from the document. Thanks!","2026-01-09T10:33:07.730Z"],["3798317","LSS-60999","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","SD: [https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/337783?blocked=true&returnTo=%2Fcontracts%2Fv2%3FCONTRACTSV3_SEARCH%3DeyJxdWVyeSI6W3siZmllbGROYW1lIjoicXVlcnkiLCJ2YWx1ZSI6IkdyYW5kZXphIEUgQW1wbGl0dWRlLCBVbmlwZXNzb2FsLCBMZGEiLCJvcGVyYXRvciI6ImVxIn1dfQ%253D%253D%26clusterId%3DEU%26workspaceId%3D31839&clusterId=EU&workspaceId=31839|https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/337783?blocked=true&returnTo=%2Fcontracts%2Fv2%3FCONTRACTSV3_SEARCH%3DeyJxdWVyeSI6W3siZmllbGROYW1lIjoicXVlcnkiLCJ2YWx1ZSI6IkdyYW5kZXphIEUgQW1wbGl0dWRlLCBVbmlwZXNzb2FsLCBMZGEiLCJvcGVyYXRvciI6ImVxIn1dfQ%253D%253D%26clusterId%3DEU%26workspaceId%3D31839&clusterId=EU&workspaceId=31839|smart-link] ","2026-01-09T10:33:15.098Z"],["3798320","LSS-59634","LSS","petr.kratky@bolt.eu","Petr Krátký","Hello, you can close the ticket. They are not responding","2026-01-09T10:33:37.127Z"],["3798322","LSS-57756","LSS","jakub.choros@bolt.eu","Jakub Choroś","Hey [~accountid:712020:b971e044-987e-4f04-8fbe-2c3b651e5a0f] , apologies for the slow updates here.\n\n[~accountid:63f742e4e8216251ae4e4ef6], would you be able to take this over from here?","2026-01-09T10:34:10.459Z"],["3798324","PFI-831271","PFI","yvette.liu@bolt.eu","Yvette Liu","Hi [~accountid:5d96f0fd7a6d950c289dfeea] , I understand that may be the case; however, this promo code is from a partnership. So the user is subscribed as a higher tier at our partner’s platform which provides them with this code for discounted rides a month. \n\nLooking back at her profile it is indeed confusing, but she’s still finish rides, is there any logic that we can exempt the person?\n\n\n","2026-01-09T10:34:32.216Z"],["3798327","WFM-9884","WFM","ruxandra.dumitrescu@bolt.eu","Ruxandra-Elena Dumitrescu","Hello! role was approved and added; Closing the other request as well (WFM-9916)","2026-01-09T10:35:34.611Z"],["3798328","WFM-9916","WFM","ruxandra.dumitrescu@bolt.eu","Ruxandra-Elena Dumitrescu","solved here [https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/servicedesk/projects/WFM/queues/issue/WFM-9884|https://taxify.atlassian.net/jira/servicedesk/projects/WFM/queues/issue/WFM-9884|smart-link] ","2026-01-09T10:35:42.994Z"],["3798331","LSS-60361","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","[~accountid:6423e317b05b4e3e7dabadb6] - Do You think it will be done within next week? I will be leaving at the end of next week so all pending matters will either be closed or handed over.","2026-01-09T10:36:03.392Z"],["3798332","RISK2-2630","RISK2","anni.faltis@bolt.eu","Anni Faltis","Forwarded feedback to Procurement (Maarja) and Legal Operations (Paula) [here|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C09TATC5K62/p1767880182741089?thread_ts=1765282512.485049&cid=C09TATC5K62]:\n\nI’ve reviewed the scoring logic description, and it looks solid in terms of explaining how each risk type has its own weight and how this contributes to the final risk score.\n\nHowever, as discussed during the walkthroughs with Zycus, what’s still missing are *clear descriptions of the risk types themselves*. For example, for _Financial Risk_, it’s currently unclear what specific risk events fall under this category (e.g. bankruptcy, financial loss, litigation costs, closure of operations) and how these translate into the different risk levels.\n\nAt the moment, we have guidance stating that each category has a certain weight, but not what the category actually covers in practice. This makes it difficult to interpret why a supplier is flagged as _Low_ vs _Severe Financial Risk_.\n\nRecommendation:\n\n* Add short *contextual descriptions or hover-over help text* for each risk type and its sub-types, explaining:\n** What types of risk events are included\n** What criteria or thresholds drive the scoring (e.g. indicative financial impact ranges, i.e what time of financial loss is low risk, what type of financial risk is high risk)\n\nThis would help ensure the scoring is applied and interpreted consistently across teams.","2026-01-09T10:36:06.147Z"],["3798335","DRX-27761","DRX","ajinkya.deshmukh@bolt.eu","Ajinkya Suhas Deshmukh","Tested Car Branding Verification Banner on DA and DI.\n\n!CarBranding.mp4|width=320,alt=\"CarBranding.mp4\"!\n\n ","2026-01-09T10:36:34.872Z"],["3798338","DSR-3571","DSR","sigrid.hobejarv@bolt.eu","Sigrid Hõbejärv","Communications file added\n[~accountid:712020:910c9a84-3532-4a39-97d2-4aee154ce8df]  Please let me know if anything else is required or we can share with WIE","2026-01-09T10:36:41.258Z"],["3798340","DRX-27973","DRX","ajinkya.deshmukh@bolt.eu","Ajinkya Suhas Deshmukh","Tested Car Branding Verification Banner on DA and DI.\n\n!CarBranding.mp4|width=320,alt=\"CarBranding.mp4\"!\n\n ","2026-01-09T10:36:50.092Z"],["3798341","WFM-9899","WFM","ruxandra.dumitrescu@bolt.eu","Ruxandra-Elena Dumitrescu","then request only this one for them> CS - Rides - OPS Pilot (360158) ; as they already have access to Beehive ","2026-01-09T10:37:05.251Z"],["3798342","WFM-9920","WFM","ramin.karimov@bolt.eu","Ramin Karimov","I confirm the request(/) ","2026-01-09T10:37:14.965Z"],["3798343","LSS-60756","LSS","alexandre.lancastre@bolt.eu","Alexandre Lancastre","Hey team [~accountid:712020:1a3a17cb-2e37-4162-8d95-4d1059255d7e] [~accountid:6149a0e9ba1b34006ab04897] ,\n\nAny news on this one?\n\nThe client wants to move forward and we’re stuck at this stage still. Please let me know.\n\nThanks,\n\nAlex","2026-01-09T10:37:21.288Z"],["3798346","LSS-59634","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","Thank You! Ticket will be closed.","2026-01-09T10:37:32.493Z"],["3798349","BP-8156","BP","edvardsjanis.recickis@bolt.eu","Edvards Jānis Rečickis","Investigation results re: new columns in reseller_order\n\nAppears to be used with 3.5 year old orders. NOT used in code anymore.\n\nExample search with “lat” column. Search with “order_id” also retrieved the same rows.\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-09 at 12.37.02.png|width=749,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-09 at 12.37.02.png\"!","2026-01-09T10:37:45.619Z"],["3798350","SREC-60","SREC","kristjan.hiis@bolt.eu","Kristjan Hiis","Sent 60+ domains for migration\n\n\n\n|domain|\n|[+bolt-outsource.e+|https://my.101domain.com/dQBkAQAQAFz10u5B1_2AAkXzZwVLUPLHmtXVFlMqLOnYwNLgjpjbHYCT6WPBoSKA5tLv2y-FyvJ5Z54UlHsPrYvStq3xjydvfbr1i6klSzCZwBjmHt/3l.html?per=30]u|\n|[+bolt.ad+|https://my.101domain.com/dQBkAQAQAFz10u5B1_2AAkXzZwVLUPLHmtXVFlMqLOnYwNLgjpjbiSL7cCOQZ-L43kBN148I8dum0sTAISudunkC7nzWs16wt-jwXNMZizqmguH8w7/BL.html?per=30]|\n|[