.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments initiated the payout. Please check if the payout has reached FINISHED state","2026-01-09T12:16:31.084Z"],["3798860","PFI-828648","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments initiated the payout. Please check if the payout has reached FINISHED state","2026-01-09T12:16:33.359Z"],["3798861","LSS-59297","LSS","elina.andrijevska@bolt.eu","Elīna Andrijevska","[~accountid:62a7061fbf7afc006f3a8000] , I am closing the ticket since no action has been taken here for over 1 month. ","2026-01-09T12:16:35.597Z"],["3798862","PFI-828735","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments initiated the payout. Please check if the payout has reached FINISHED state","2026-01-09T12:16:35.994Z"],["3798863","PFI-827558","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments initiated the payout. Please check if the payout has reached FINISHED state","2026-01-09T12:16:38.303Z"],["3798865","PFI-830943","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments initiated the payout. Please check if the payout has reached FINISHED state","2026-01-09T12:16:40.904Z"],["3798866","PFI-830826","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments initiated the payout. Please check if the payout has reached FINISHED state","2026-01-09T12:16:43.611Z"],["3798867","PFI-829461","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","Closing this ticket; invoice has been issued with invoice number now.","2026-01-09T12:17:02.514Z"],["3798869","LSS-52369","LSS","kristiina.klemm@bolt.eu","Kristiina Klemm","Hi All! [~accountid:61fd40abc224b80069c9d6cf] [~accountid:712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a] [~accountid:712020:985a985c-b403-41bd-b116-abbf44b22175] we have the latest feedback to our draft and Zellis redlines here. [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HkNTtZXmJ1MW5MHlU1gV29OeJVFsroWr/edit|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HkNTtZXmJ1MW5MHlU1gV29OeJVFsroWr/edit|smart-link] \n\n","2026-01-09T12:17:25.441Z"],["3798870","RDS-1332","RDS","joonas.niiholm@bolt.eu","Joonas Niiholm","[~accountid:61386b11a4f86e0069546dff]  \n\n* driver must wait at stop for 5 minutes before driver can initiate a cancellation -turn into separate RDS","2026-01-09T12:17:28.028Z"],["3798871","PFI-819081","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","Please, contact a partner payments Team for payment matching","2026-01-09T12:17:49.881Z"],["3798873","PFI-819081","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Thank you for submitting this ticket!\n\nLooks like you've selected invalid Request Type which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! \n\n- [Partner Payments] Business made payment, but didn't reflect: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/306\n- [Customer Payments] Business had issues with their credit card: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/303\n\n- Fraud related issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/304\n\n[Billing] - Business invoicing and balance issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/305\n\n[Billing/Tax Tech]- Business invoice has not been reported (Fiscalized) : https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247\n- Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301\n\n\nCheers\nCommerce Team Jira Bot","2026-01-09T12:17:55.266Z"],["3798874","DSR-3077","DSR","priit.lehis@bolt.eu","Priit Lehis","Data and response sent out. ","2026-01-09T12:17:55.903Z"],["3798875","RDS-340","RDS","joonas.niiholm@bolt.eu","Joonas Niiholm","* still waiting for CS to start {{2026-01-19}}","2026-01-09T12:17:56.871Z"],["3798876","HS-28730","HS","kerilin.mand@bolt.eu","Kerilin Mänd","Hi [~accountid:712020:af987dc6-5d01-4b78-85a4-1365b29ddf64],\n\nDoes he need it wet signed and stamped or is a digitally signed version okay? \n\nBest regards,\n\nKerilin ","2026-01-09T12:18:11.750Z"],["3798877","PFI-831378","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-09T12:18:26.481Z"],["3798881","LSS-52369","LSS","thomas.harper@bolt.eu","Thomas Harper","Thanks [~accountid:712020:4afbd60d-276d-4d8c-8d4c-5669fd772468] - what is the deadline for our review / next round of comments? Just so that I can prioritise this as needed 🙂 ","2026-01-09T12:19:29.872Z"],["3798883","PFI-831379","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nBusiness ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=282576311\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-09T12:20:03.702Z"],["3798885","RDS-1389","RDS","joonas.niiholm@bolt.eu","Joonas Niiholm","* [~accountid:712020:eb64fa24-b70d-49d6-b62c-e4560e7e1457] \n* Designs ready. \n* Once resources available, kickoff will begin soon for non ios dev. \n** partially restricted by iOS bottleneck","2026-01-09T12:20:20.155Z"],["3798886","EBIKE1-379","EBIKE1","sander.viitak@bolt.eu","Sander Viitak","Finished drawings and all components are in BOM","2026-01-09T12:20:36.926Z"],["3798888","RDS-1049","RDS","joonas.niiholm@bolt.eu","Joonas Niiholm","* Dima and Joonas to review list of improvements to prioritize\n* feature-acceptance-screen-revamp channel archived","2026-01-09T12:21:10.019Z"],["3798890","L10N-27001","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26998](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26998)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-09T12:21:36.523Z"],["3798891","L10N-27002","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-26998](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-26998)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-09T12:21:37.379Z"],["3798892","L10N-27004","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the co