 via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-10T07:00:16.892Z"],["3800117","PFI-815018","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Daniel Novo,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-10T07:00:16.999Z"],["3800118","LSS-58451","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Anouar Miled,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-10T07:00:21.201Z"],["3800119","LSS-58680","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Gabriel Gonçalo,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-10T07:00:21.251Z"],["3800120","LSS-60166","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Sónia Caetano,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-10T07:00:23.063Z"],["3800121","LSS-53138","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Dear Ruska Giorgadze,\n\nThere hasn’t been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days and it is in the status “Waiting for customer”. Please give an update on the status of this issue. If you do not respond within a reasonable time, we will close the ticket.\n\nThank you in advance!","2026-01-10T07:00:44.684Z"],["3800161","LSS-60177","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Dawit Villarzu,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-10T07:02:53.427Z"],["3800162","LSS-60140","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Stefano Roggiero,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-10T07:02:53.788Z"],["3800164","PFI-831252","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The Early Cashout is still pending (last update 2026-01-08) and was created very recently, so it’s in progress and should be reflected on the courier’s bank account shortly/next business day. We’re monitoring pending payouts and will act on any provider checks; if it remains pending or unreceived after 2–3 business days from creation, please reply to this ticket.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:12:31.791Z"],["3800165","PFI-831279","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed (VALUE DATE 2025-11-24). Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; it will show the beneficiary bank and account number used so you can confirm where the funds were sent. If the bank details on the profile were incorrect at that time, the transfer went to those details; if the partner hasn’t received the funds, please ask them to contact their bank for tracing. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:12:58.091Z"],["3800166","PFI-831305","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This Early Cashout was rejected due to a technical error during transmission; the payment provider did not give a specific reason. Please inform the partner that it will be reprocessed in the next regular payout cycle; if they need funds sooner, they can submit the Early Cashout again now. If you have any other questions, please reply to this ticket. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase.","2026-01-10T07:13:42.030Z"],["3800167","PFI-831313","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout’s last status is Exported on 2026-01-05, which means it has been sent for processing and is still in progress. As it has stayed in this state for several days, the delay is likely due to an ongoing compliance review or technical processing on the provider’s side; we are monitoring and will finalize it as soon as possible. Please inform the partner that no action is needed from their side right now and that the status will update once the payout is completed. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:14:16.809Z"],["3800168","PFI-831380","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This Early Cashout has been in pending since 16 December, which is longer than usual; the delay is likely due to an ongoing compliance review or a technical issue on the payment provider’s side. Please inform the partner that we are monitoring the case and respond to any provider compliance requests immediately; no action is required from their side for now. The payout will be processed as soon as it is cleared, and the status will update automatically.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:14:50.802Z"],["3800169","PFI-831387","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been successfully processed (state: finished) with value date 2025-12-29. We cannot redirect or recall a payout after it’s processed; if the partner hasn’t received it (e.g., due to the old account closure), please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it so they can check with their bank. Please also ensure the partner updates their bank details in the app for future payouts. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:15:19.402Z"],["3800170","PFI-831396","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout was rejected by the payment provider, and they did not share a specific reason. It will be automatically reprocessed in the next regular payout cycle; if this was an Early Cashout, the partner can try requesting it again. Since the driver recently changed bank details, please ask them to verify the new account information is correct to prevent another rejection. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase—feedback is welcome.","2026-01-10T07:15:51.678Z"],["3800171","PFI-831455","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been in pending status since 16 December, which is longer than usual; it’s likely delayed due to an ongoing compliance review or a technical issue on the payment provider’s side. Please inform the partner that no action is required from their side—we are monitoring the case and responding to any provider requests immediately, and the payout will be processed once cleared. We’ll update this ticket as soon as the status changes. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:16:35.338Z"],["3800172","PFI-831475","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout has been pending since 22 Dec and the delay is likely due to an ongoing compliance review or technical issue on the payment provider’s side. We are monitoring it closely and respond to any provider requests immediately; no action is required from the partner at this time. The status will update automatically once it clears.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-10T07:17:10.118Z"],["3800176","PFI-824075","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi there, we haven't heard from you in a while. If you would like to keep this request open or if you have additional information, just reply.","2026-01-10T07:30:28.125Z"],["3800177","PFI-824110","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi there, we haven't heard from you in a while. If you would like to keep this request open or if you have additional information, just reply.","2026-01-10T07:30:29.100Z"],["3800178","PFI-831639","PFI","chaiyachat.sabphaso@bolt-outsource.eu","Chaiyachat Sabphaso","!image-20260110-073038.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T07:30:47.076Z"],["3800180","PFI-831641","PFI","chaiyachat.sabphaso@bolt-outsource.eu","Chaiyachat Sabphaso","!image-20260110-073311.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260110-073632.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T07:37:27.606Z"],["3800187","PFI-831279","PFI","jan.stransky@bolt-outsource.eu","Jan Stransky","The payout was sent back to us will the tracing help in such case?","2026-01-10T08:03:39.504Z"],["3800188","PFI-830408","PFI","lilit.vardanyan@bolt-outsource.eu","Lilit Vardanyan","Thank you!","2026-01-10T08:07:24.448Z"],["3800191","FDBT-4764","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-10T08:20:15.151Z"],["3800193","PFI-831648","PFI","chidiebere.ukaegbu@bolt-outsource.eu","Chidiebere Ukaegbu","!JPEG_1767939537516_5586329705473875887.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T08:24:26.610Z"],["3800200","PFI-827148","PFI","eliska.rislerova@bolt-outsource.eu","Eliska Rislerova","Hi, any news?","2026-01-10T08:50:45.620Z"],["3800201","PFI-827148","PFI","eliska.rislerova@bolt-outsource.eu","Eliska Rislerova","There is also another fleet that has the same problem [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/fleet-company/companies/edit/189589?tab=profile|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/fleet-company/companies/edit/189589?tab=profile]","2026-01-10T08:52:08.210Z"],["3800210","WFM-9931","WFM","giovanna.novaes@bolt.eu","Giovanna Sochiarelli da Costa Novaes","Hello,\n\nDisruptive comms are live. ","2026-01-10T09:25:45.259Z"],["3800218","WFM-9932","WFM","giovanna.novaes@bolt.eu","Giovanna Sochiarelli da Costa Novaes","Hello, Elvyra.\n\nSince the last [*request*|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/1068/WFM-9931?created=true] was made for all user personas, RH vertical was also included. Comms are live for every vertical.","2026-01-10T09:44:30.345Z"],["3800222","PFI-816884","PFI","sofia.zolotariova@bolt-outsource.eu","Sofia Zolotariova","Hello! Can we get an answer here? Thanks in advance!","2026-01-10T09:54:29.531Z"],["3800227","PFI-831662","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-10T10:06:05.009Z"],["3800248","PFI-831679","PFI","theotocia.mwikali@bolt-outsource.eu","Theotocia Mwikali","[^Understanding your balance - Customer Support - Beehive.mhtml]","2026-01-10T10:55:06.631Z"],["3800250","PFI-813484","PFI","aydan.kazimova@bolt-outsource.eu","Aydan Kazimova","hello?","2026-01-10T10:58:57.984Z"],["3800251","PFI-828800","PFI","aydan.kazimova@bolt-outsource.eu","Aydan Kazimova","hello, any update?","2026-01-10T11:01:02.655Z"],["3800254","PFI-831689","PFI","salome.jintcharadze@bolt.eu","Salome Jintcharadze","!charge 2.jpeg|thumbnail!\n\n!charge.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T11:19:47.585Z"],["3800255","PFI-824668","PFI","mykhailo.stepanov@bolt-outsource.eu","Mykhailo Stepanov","Hi team! Are there any updates on his payout?\n\n","2026-01-10T11:22:40.669Z"],["3800257","LSS-61367","LSS","britta.haal@bolt.eu","Britta Hääl","Hi, this has been handled in the legal ticket: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/LSS-60062|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/LSS-60062|smart-link]. The process is in progress, and you may cancel this ticket. Thank you!","2026-01-10T11:33:19.872Z"],["3800263","RCE-338","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Compliance triage [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1768045849131099]*{color}:\nThank you for the report, <@stanislavs.kulss>!\n\nOur team duty champion will review [your request|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/RCE-338] `Create driver selfie verification task for Germany` soon.\n{quote}","2026-01-10T11:51:01.366Z"],["3800264","RCE-336","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Staņislavs Kuļšs [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1768045873271489]*{color}:\nHey! <@UCVT712UR>\nI think [here|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PRODWIKI/pages/3871768748/Driver+Selfie+Verification#Configuration-per-market] should be all of the information you need :slightly_smiling_face:\nI have attached a screenshot for Germany as I assume that was the country of interest.\n\nLinked files:\n* [Screenshot 2026-01-10 at 13.51.00.png|https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T049H2DT1QQ-F0A81NHHWJ0/screenshot_2026-01-10_at_13.51.00.png]\n{quote}","2026-01-10T11:51:25.321Z"],["3800265","RCE-338","RCE","maksim.shashkov@bolt.eu","Max Shashkov","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Staņislavs Kuļšs [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1768045901050549]*{color}:\nMeant to answer in a thread:sorry1:\n{quote}","2026-01-10T11:51:53.352Z"],["3800271","PFI-801465","PFI","milena.prazynska@bolt-outsource.eu","Milena Prazynska","?","2026-01-10T12:10:44.100Z"],["3800274","PFI-831710","PFI","giorgi.chachava@bolt.eu","Giorgi Chachava","!failed_payment.png|thumbnail!\n\n!failed_payment2.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T12:24:07.998Z"],["3800276","LSS-50913","LSS","edik.davtian@bolt.eu","Edik Davtian","Hello [~accountid:712020:02e8ad5d-a35d-44b9-b445-6111cdb230dc] \n\nThe signed agreement is[ here|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1u21y4EvhvLkauy5ed0KQEUq6AKNaBtkz/view?usp=sharing]. \n\nPlease proceed with archiving & closing the ticket.\n\n\n\nThanks everyone for support - now it is on business to execute it well.\n\n\n\nBR,\n\nEdik\n\n","2026-01-10T12:34:33.224Z"],["3800277","LSS-50913","LSS","edik.davtian@bolt.eu","Edik Davtian","Also, [~accountid:6061907490e3950069a3a5d3] , please proceed with closing Infosec open ticket [+ISS-845+|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/17/ISS-845]- cause after our explanatory comments - RIMI stopped pursuing to change those Clauses  & accepted as is. ","2026-01-10T12:36:57.154Z"],["3800279","PFI-831380","PFI","yuliia.nenasheva@bolt.eu","Yuliia Nenasheva","Hello, please. Is there any updates?","2026-01-10T12:46:06.780Z"],["3800281","PFI-816791","PFI","monika.jurcik@bolt-outsource.eu","Monika Jurčík","Hello team!! Any update? ","2026-01-10T12:54:21.239Z"],["3800283","PFI-831662","PFI","nikolai.rol@bolt.eu","Nikolay Roll","👋 Hey there!\n\nLooks like you've selected an *invalid Request Type* which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! 🚗\n\n*PAYMENTS*\n* *[Customer Payments]* Driver/Fleet payment didn't reflect: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/311]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Manual payout request to Payments team: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/432]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Driver/Fleet payout issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/312]\n* *[Customer Payments]* Rider payment/charge issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/307]\n\n----\n\n*TECH SUPPORT*\n* *Driver/Fleet Campaign and Bonus issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/597]\n* *Driver app/backend/earning screen issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66]\n* *Rider app/backend issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/103]\n* *Wrong price calculation for the order:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/354]\n\n----\n\n*FRAUD*\n* *Fraud related issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/308]\n\n----\n\n*BILLING*\n* *Driver/Fleet Balance Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet Invoicing and Reports Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet/Rider Fiscalization (e.g. Missing QR, SAF-T) issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247]\n* *Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301]\n\nCheers,\n_Billing Ops AI_\n\nThis an automated message created to help resolving requests using our available knowledge base and tools. In case of any doubts or concerns please leave the comment, and our team will revert shortly. Alternatively, please, ask in *#commerce-support-billing* Slack channel.","2026-01-10T13:00:43.431Z"],["3800295","PFI-831743","PFI","favour.isaac@bolt-outsource.eu","Favour Isaac","[^Support case_ 720079277 - Customer Support - Beehive.html]","2026-01-10T13:28:28.749Z"],["3800296","PFI-816791","PFI","nikoleta.mikusova@bolt-outsource.eu","Nikoleta Mikušova","Hello, pls, any update? ","2026-01-10T13:29:58.361Z"],["3800310","PFI-831432","PFI","bartosz.ciesluk@bolt-outsource.eu","Bartosz Ciesluk","Hello [~accountid:5d96f0fd7a6d950c289dfeea] \n\nIt appears that this rider should have been UID blocked at the time when the previous agent created the SD, but it was unfortunately missed. In this case, there is no need for you to take any action, as we can simply remove the scheduled block. Sorry for the inconvenience!\n\nRegards,\nBartosz","2026-01-10T14:21:54.077Z"],["3800314","PFI-831761","PFI","jaunius.kaluzevicius@bolt-outsource.eu","Jaunius Kaluževičius","!Screenshot_20260108_155729_Samsung Internet.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!Screenshot_20260108_155737_Samsung Internet.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T14:33:57.480Z"],["3800322","PFI-822021","PFI","ivan.farkasovsky@bolt-outsource.eu","Ivan Farkasovsky","Any update please? Courier keeps complaining. ","2026-01-10T14:51:46.257Z"],["3800328","PFI-831768","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nDelivery ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1961738486\n","2026-01-10T15:05:32.054Z"],["3800331","PFI-831769","PFI","laura.laul@bolt-outsource.eu","Laura Laul","!IMG_3577.png|thumbnail!\n\n!IMG_3578.jpeg|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T15:16:48.322Z"],["3800339","PFI-831775","PFI","pedro.ferreira@bolt-outsource.eu","Pedro Ferreira","!Campaign1.png|thumbnail!\n\n!Campaign2.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T15:41:49.813Z"],["3800342","INT-800","INT","vivekkumar.singh@bolt.eu","Vivek Kumar Singh","26W02 Update:\n\n* Analysis across LFP segments and sub-segments has been completed (attached to the Context section of the ticket), and the product requirements have been finalised.\n* *Next steps:* Discuss the requirements with Engineering in CW 03 to assess effort and align on the decision for further rollout of the Winback Campaign v1.0 (currently live with user cohort optimisation but only in top 20 markets).","2026-01-10T15:51:29.079Z"],["3800354","FDBT-4758","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-10T16:14:38.545Z"],["3800358","INT-799","INT","vivekkumar.singh@bolt.eu","Vivek Kumar Singh","26W02 Update:\n\n* Analysis completed for the validation experiments (attached to the Context section of the ticket) and aligned decision to productise the feature which needs both\n** UX development in Driver App\n** Tooling in Admin tool\n* *Next steps:* Alignment with Driver X for design support and timelines to be done in CW 03.","2026-01-10T16:18:28.777Z"],["3800360","FDBT-4759","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-10T16:22:03.066Z"],["3800362","FDBT-4760","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-10T16:26:49.610Z"],["3800363","CSXDL-174","CSXDL","robert.aavik@bolt.eu","Robert Aavik","V1’s output: [https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/dashboards/29473?Report+Date+Filter=1+day+ago+for+1+day&Country+Name=Azerbaijan%2CCroatia%2CCyprus%2CCzech+Republic%2CEstonia%2CGhana%2CKenya%2CLatvia%2CLithuania%2CMalta%2CPoland%2CPortugal%2CRomania%2CSlovakia%2CUkraine%2CBulgaria|https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/dashboards/29473?Report+Date+Filter=1+day+ago+for+1+day&Country+Name=Azerbaijan%2CCroatia%2CCyprus%2CCzech+Republic%2