ests/view/571665] raised ","2026-01-10T18:15:22.637Z"],["3800413","PFI-831820","PFI","kasidid.witthayanukhraoh@bolt-outsource.eu","Kasidid Witthayanukhraoh","!image-20260110-184542.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T18:51:37.693Z"],["3800417","PFI-831822","PFI","lolonyo.kamassa@bolt-outsource.eu","Lolonyo Emmanuel Kamassa","!Screenshot 2026-01-10 7.11.43 PM.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T19:12:15.093Z"],["3800427","PFI-829795","PFI","ogechukwu.ohaji@bolt-outsource.eu","Ogechukwu Ohaji","Hi Team,\n\nPartner wants to delete his account but has a positive balance of R5.66\n\nPlease assist.","2026-01-10T19:37:47.557Z"],["3800438","PFI-831843","PFI","mariana.madlova@bolt-outsource.eu","Mariana Madlova","!Screenshot_20260110_194424_Bolt.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-10T20:19:21.059Z"],["3800439","PFI-829032","PFI","shirlyne.kepher@bolt-outsource.eu","Shirlyne Kepher","@*Nikolay Roll*\n","2026-01-10T20:26:32.225Z"],["3800441","PFI-831845","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-10T20:41:54.164Z"],["3800455","DRX-27817","DRX","ios.ci.robot@bolt.eu","ios.ci robot","2QA: enter a cancellation reason bottom sheet (for decline regular/scheduled orders flow):\nplease verify the cases when \"No internet connection\" banner appears while a snackbar is displayed on the screen> it should match the design.","2026-01-10T21:30:11.720Z"],["3800457","RDS-1401","RDS","dashiell.stanford@bolt.eu","Dash Stanford","Final note — basically none of our competitors expose this info in the category list. This may be because it’s too challenging to reflect an accurate bag count, or because even if it’s exposed, riders still order the wrong category. So this may not “work” the way we intend.\n\nStill, if it’s easy to test (especially in areas where we know travellers usually have bags, like airports), seems worthwhile to get some data on whether this helps avoid friction/cancellations.","2026-01-10T21:37:40.120Z"],["3800479","PFI-829495","PFI","nikita.laar@bolt-outsource.eu","Nikita Laar","can it be reopened?","2026-01-10T23:49:45.530Z"],["3800480","PFI-829495","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋  Thank you for the response. Looks like this ticket is already resolved. \n\nIf the issue persists, please feel free to reopen your request via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/-1 or reach out through #commerce-support-billing.\n\nCheers\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-10T23:49:50.094Z"],["3800481","PFI-831888","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nDelivery ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1961738486\n","2026-01-11T00:08:45.408Z"],["3800487","PFI-826774","PFI","rodrigo.espinola@bolt-outsource.eu","Rodrigo Ariel Benitez Espinola","Hi team! Do you have an update regarding this case?\n\nThanks in advance.","2026-01-11T00:53:00.630Z"],["3800500","PFI-813904","PFI","chotika.jungajung@bolt-outsource.eu","Chotika Jungajung","Dear relevant team \n\nKindly follow up the case.","2026-01-11T02:05:10.772Z"],["3800503","FDBT-4761","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_pipeline_rentals fails on 2026-01-10 02:30:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInst