.\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-11T07:01:30.191Z"],["3800579","PFI-819317","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Wiktoria Dzięgo,\n\nSince we haven’t received a response, we’re closing this ticket. If you still need help, please reopen it via our service desk https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3 or #commerce-support-billing\n\nCheers,\nBilling Team Jira Bot","2026-01-11T07:01:30.304Z"],["3800580","LSS-59864","LSS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi Angela Noguera,\n\nThere hasn't been any activity in this ticket for 30+ days. Please:\n1) Close the ticket if the issue has been resolved or is not relevant anymore; or\n2) Give an update; or\n3) Change to “Waiting for customer” status if you are waiting to hear back from the reporter. If the reporter is not responding within a reasonable time, add a comment stating this and close the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-11T07:02:03.709Z"],["3800583","PFI-831643","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-11T07:05:06.149Z"],["3800584","PFI-831797","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-11T07:05:08.278Z"],["3800585","PFI-831818","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. I noticed that your ticket does not include a valid payout link, so the Partner Payments Team may not be able to help with it.\n                         \n        If your request is related to a specific payout/Early Cashout, please kindly create a new ticket and add a valid payout link. You can find the payout link here: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts\n        Pro tip: if the link does not fit into the field, copy and paste only this part: https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/invoicing-payment/payouts/view/XXXXXXXXX\n\n        If your question is not related to a specific payout, please kindly wait until a Partner Payments Specialist reviews your request.\n        \n        If you wish to ask a general question, you can also contact us via our Slack channel #commerce-support-partner-payments.","2026-01-11T07:05:10.575Z"],["3800586","FDBT-4769","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T07:08:38.323Z"],["3800587","PFI-831700","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout was rejected by the bank: the error code indicates a UPI transfer failure on the beneficiary side (typically an invalid/inactive UPI ID or a restriction at the beneficiary bank). Please ask the partner to verify and, if needed, update their beneficiary details (UPI ID or bank account/IFSC) so the payment can go through; the payout will be reprocessed in the next regular cycle once details are correct. If this was an Early Cashout, they can try requesting it again after fixing the details. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-11T07:10:43.890Z"],["3800588","PFI-831795","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This early cashout is still pending (last update on 2026-01-07), which is longer than usual and likely due to a compliance review or a technical delay on the provider’s side. Our team is monitoring pending payouts and responds to any checks immediately—no action is needed from the courier right now. Please inform the courier the transfer is in progress and will be credited once the provider releases it.\nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-11T07:11:06.988Z"],["3800589","PFI-831922","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nBusiness ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=282576311\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-11T07:11:33.221Z"],["3800590","PFI-831822","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is still pending at the provider under payment validation/compliance review since 2025-12-22, which explains the delay. Please inform the partner that no action is needed from their side; our team is monitoring the case and responds to any provider compliance requests as soon as they arrive. Once validation completes, the transfer will be processed automatically and the status will update accordingly. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is currently in the testing phase.","2026-01-11T07:11:47.754Z"],["3800591","PFI-831844","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The early cashout has been successfully processed with value date 2026-01-07. Please download the proof of payout (if available) and share it with the partner; if they still don’t see the funds, ask them to contact their beneficiary bank to trace the incoming transfer using the proof. If you need anything else, feel free to reply to this ticket. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-11T07:12:04.775Z"],["3800592","PFI-831882","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. The payout is currently in pending status and being processed; the last log update was on 07 Jan, which is still within normal processing time for an Early Cashout. Please ask the partner to wait a bit longer — the funds should be reflected soon, and we are monitoring pending payouts and responding to any provider checks promptly. \nP.S. Please note that the Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase. If you have any feedback, please share it with us.","2026-01-11T07:12:45.334Z"],["3800593","PFI-831739","PFI","narmin.mammadli@bolt.eu","Narmin Mammadli","Hi! Partner Payments Bot here. This payout is still in pending status (last update 2026-01-05), which is longer than usual and likely due to an ongoing compliance review or a temporary issue on the provider’s side. Please inform the partner that it’s being processed; we are monitoring it and responding to any provider requests as quickly as possible, and no action is required from their side at the moment. \nP.S. The Partner Payments Bot is in the testing phase; your feedback is welcome.","2026-01-11T07:13:41.949Z"],["3800597","FDBT-4772","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T07:30:14.797Z"],["3800599","PFI-831927","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-11T07:34:45.894Z"],["3800601","FDBT-4770","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_pipeline_delivery fails on 2026-01-10 07:00:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInstance._execute_task_with_callbacks(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3184, in _execute_task_with_callbacks\n    result = self._execute_task(context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3208, in _execute_task\n    return _execute_task(self, context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 776, in _execute_task\n    result = _execute_callable(context=context, **execute_callable_kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 742, in _execute_callable\n    return ExecutionCallableRunner(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/utils/operator_helpers.py\", line 252, in run\n    return self.func(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/baseoperator.py\", line 1816, in resume_execution\n    return execute_callable(context)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/bolt/airflow/databricks/operators/job/__init__.py\", line 45, in execute_complete\n    raise e\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/bolt/airflow/databricks/operators/job/__init__.py\", line 37, in execute_complete\n    return super(DatabricksRunNowByNameOperator, self).execute_complete(context, event)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/providers/databricks/operators/databricks.py\", line 958, in execute_complete\n    _handle_deferrable_databricks_operator_completion(event, self.log)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/providers/databricks/operators/databricks.py\", line 248, in _handle_deferrable_databricks_operator_completion\n    raise AirflowException(error_message)\nairflow.exceptions.AirflowException: Job run failed with terminal state: {'life_cycle_state': 'INTERNAL_ERROR', 'result_state': 'FAILED', 'state_message': 'Task pl_and_ledger_task failed with message: Workload failed, see run output for details. This caused all downstream tasks to get skipped.'} and with the errors [{'error': 'SystemExit: 11', 'run_id': 187300499718012, 'task_key': 'pl_and_ledger_task'}]\n\n        Log URL: https://airflow-commerce.data.boltint.net/dags/commerce_finance_pipeline_delivery/grid?dag_run_id=scheduled__2026-01-10T07%3A00%3A00%2B00%3A00&task_id=delivery_market.delivery_market&base_date=2026-01-10T07%3A00%3A00.000000%2B0000&tab=logs\n        ","2026-01-11T07:38:03.472Z"],["3800609","FDBT-4771","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T07:57:36.119Z"],["3800611","PFI-831938","PFI","chiamaka.madujibeya@bolt-outsource.eu","Chiamaka Madujibeya","!Screenshot_20260111_093318_capitec_acuity_mobile_prod_MainActivity.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T08:03:25.420Z"],["3800612","WD-22455","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","HR001 was activated on 05/01/2026 and inactivated on 11/01/2026","2026-01-11T08:08:52.407Z"],["3800613","WD-19225","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","You revaluation rules based on accounting books were implemented (details are here [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/WDFTECH/pages/7120585034/Currency+Rate+Types+and+Revaluation+Rules|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/WDFTECH/pages/7120585034/Currency+Rate+Types+and+Revaluation+Rules|smart-link] )  and applied to Dec 2025 period ","2026-01-11T08:11:17.969Z"],["3800614","FDBT-4773","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T08:13:17.297Z"],["3800615","WDFT-3534","WDFT","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","Note: it is possible to set a percentage in the Disposal EIB to be written off and in that case Workday generates correct accounting. After such disposal Asset become partialy disposed and there is no way to reinstate disposed portion afterwards. ","2026-01-11T08:13:41.396Z"],["3800617","WD-21974","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","Two revaluation approaches  were implemented for revaluation of balances of companies, whose ledger account is one of these: *AZN, CZK, KZT, PLN, PYG, RON, SEK, TND, or UAH*.\n\ndetails here - > [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/WDFTECH/pages/7120585034/Currency+Rate+Types+and+Revaluation+Rules|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/WDFTECH/pages/7120585034/Currency+Rate+Types+and+Revaluation+Rules|smart-link] \n\nFor Group / IFRS accounting book revaluation uses FX market rate , which should remove differences. ","2026-01-11T08:16:52.982Z"],["3800618","WD-16950","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","The issue should be fixed with new revaluation rules that take into account differences in balances in accounting books \n\nDetails here - > [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/WDFTECH/pages/7120585034/Currency+Rate+Types+and+Revaluation+Rules|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/WDFTECH/pages/7120585034/Currency+Rate+Types+and+Revaluation+Rules|smart-link] ","2026-01-11T08:20:29.414Z"],["3800621","PFI-829210","PFI","mary.adjakonor@bolt-outsource.eu","Mary Adjakonor","Hello Team,\n\nPlease confirm if there is any update on this refund.\n\nWe await your response.\n\nMary","2026-01-11T08:32:22.076Z"],["3800622","WD-21607","WD","iryna.stepanko@bolt.eu","Iryna Stepanko","Hi Kaili!\n\nYou can not add reports to report group , if the report does not have any saved filters.\n\nFor report _Bolt New P&L – Multi-Quarter Overview_ you need\n\n* go to report definition and on tab Advances out tick mark nexT to Enable Save Parameters. This will allow you save filters \n!image-20260111-084419.png|width=1183,alt=\"image-20260111-084419.png\"!\n* then you need to run the report , put some relevant for report prompts and save the filter  (here I filled required field and saved it as “IRA TEST” filter)\n!image-20260111-084625.png|width=1164,alt=\"image-20260111-084625.png\"!\n* then you can go to task Create Group and prompts and proceed further \n* on tab Reports now you will be able to select Report and select respective saved filter \n!image-20260111-084826.png|width=1164,alt=\"image-20260111-084826.png\"!","2026-01-11T08:48:35.533Z"],["3800625","HS-28483","HS","berit.mustonen@bolt.eu","Berit Mustonen","Contract signed by both parties. ","2026-01-11T08:56:52.565Z"],["3800627","PFI-831927","PFI","nikolai.rol@bolt.eu","Nikolay Roll","👋 Hey there!\n\nLooks like you've selected an *invalid Request Type* which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! 🚗\n\n*PAYMENTS*\n* *[Customer Payments]* Driver/Fleet payment didn't reflect: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/311]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Manual payout request to Payments team: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/432]\n* *[Partner Payments]* Driver/Fleet payout issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/312]\n* *[Customer Payments]* Rider payment/charge issues: [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/307]\n\n----\n\n*TECH SUPPORT*\n* *Driver/Fleet Campaign and Bonus issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/597]\n* *Driver app/backend/earning screen issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66]\n* *Rider app/backend issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/103]\n* *Wrong price calculation for the order:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/354]\n\n----\n\n*FRAUD*\n* *Fraud related issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/308]\n\n----\n\n*BILLING*\n* *Driver/Fleet Balance Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet Invoicing and Reports Disputes:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57]\n* *Driver/Fleet/Rider Fiscalization (e.g. Missing QR, SAF-T) issues:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247]\n* *Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations:* [Link|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301]\n\nCheers,\n_Billing Ops AI_\n\nThis an automated message created to help resolving requests using our available knowledge base and tools. In case of any doubts or concerns please leave the comment, and our team will revert shortly. Alternatively, please, ask in *#commerce-support-billing* Slack channel.","2026-01-11T09:00:39.544Z"],["3800632","PFI-831958","PFI","emefiok.udoh@bolt-outsource.eu","Emefiok Udoh","!20251218_070716.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T09:27:18.064Z"],["3800643","PFI-831961","PFI","chidiebere.ukaegbu@bolt-outsource.eu","Chidiebere Ukaegbu","[^PaymentNotification.pdf]","2026-01-11T09:45:05.818Z"],["3800645","PFI-825462","PFI","emefiok.udoh@bolt-outsource.eu","Emefiok Udoh","Dear team, driver’s payment is yet to reflect. Please assist.","2026-01-11T09:51:21.304Z"],["3800646","FDBT-4775","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T09:51:23.629Z"],["3800647","PFI-831927","PFI","georgios.bamos@bolt.eu","Georgios Thomas Bamos","Different issue","2026-01-11T09:52:40.439Z"],["3800655","PFI-829144","PFI","radka.remenikova@bolt-outsource.eu","Radka Remenikova","Hello Team, any update please? ","2026-01-11T10:47:26.338Z"],["3800656","MARTECH3-1494","MARTECH3","wahyu.herlambang@bolt.eu","Wahyu Herlambang","Status:\n\nThe experiment launch was in December and it still needs to run for some time to understand the uplift.","2026-01-11T10:48:21.436Z"],["3800659","PFI-831983","PFI","erere.eriri@bolt-outsource.eu","Erere Eriri","!image-20260111-110333.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T11:04:18.480Z"],["3800668","PFI-831992","PFI","natalia.mucha@bolt-outsource.eu","Natalia Mucha","!IMG_2641.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T11:26:40.707Z"],["3800677","FDBT-4776","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T11:44:10.048Z"],["3800678","FDBT-4777","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","Task succeeded. Closing the issue.","2026-01-11T11:49:41.974Z"],["3800683","PFI-830433","PFI","joao.santana@bolt.eu","João Victor Santana","Hello, amount of 2500 EUR now paid accordingly, Please note that partner still have remaining balance and as per the letter, the debt amount seems to be 7726.29 EUR. If funds needs to be paid to the driver or still paid to the authoritities, please submit a new ticket. ","2026-01-11T12:01:25.147Z"],["3800684","PFI-830683","PFI","joao.santana@bolt.eu","João Victor Santana","Hi, \r\n\r\nWe already have a ticket regarding this request. Payout will be handled accordingly. ","2026-01-11T12:02:48.374Z"],["3800685","PFI-831039","PFI","joao.santana@bolt.eu","João Victor Santana","Partner balance is current negative. No funds to be paid. Please monitore it for the following weeks and do let us know in case of positive balance and available payout to be received. ","2026-01-11T12:03:57.879Z"],["3800690","INT-659","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","[~accountid:6311b8e962fe1e6eac6ca2bb] Please do not post this as a reply, but rather as a separate comments, also please try not to use bullet points, thx","2026-01-11T12:09:04.848Z"],["3800691","INT-659","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","26W2: Concluded that we have enough data to stop the test early - but suggest running the experiment while we conduct the 1st steps of analysis (at least the parts of analysis that will support calibrating the price for the full rollout)","2026-01-11T12:09:16.190Z"],["3800694","INT-660","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","26W02: Sponsored Listings MVP Adoption 10.8% (+2 pp vs LM), monthly revenue 0.08% GMV RR (flat)","2026-01-11T12:11:53.876Z"],["3800695","INT-668","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","26W02: [Designs|https://www.figma.com/design/kT6eQUqoUl2qcY55XLcHfu/Merchant-Portal?node-id=44856-76525&t=Zp1cjy7BWEJvFRnD-4] are ready, starting development. ","2026-01-11T12:12:21.652Z"],["3800697","INT-741","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","26W02: Everything ready for release on the next week, making comms to local teams about new process.","2026-01-11T12:13:00.872Z"],["3800698","INT-639","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","[~accountid:5e96dc9b7a06740c103af87e] Apperciate the detailed update, but let’s try for those Idea tickets to make it more concise and as one paragraph. Made an example above.","2026-01-11T12:13:58.765Z"],["3800699","INT-639","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","26W02: Development for item tagging is ready and waiting for release. Auto-tagging is in progress.","2026-01-11T12:14:41.408Z"],["3800700","INT-1145","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","26W02: Mass migration of 2K SMB merchants from Manual ULC campaigns done, monitoring results (nothing notable yet).","2026-01-11T12:16:05.774Z"],["3800701","INT-686","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","[~accountid:5f23e70bb7a35e002a73ef5d] Any further progress here?","2026-01-11T12:16:51.610Z"],["3800705","PFI-832002","PFI","anastasia.oleinic@bolt-outsource.eu","Anastasia Oleinic","!IMG_6729.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T12:23:03.247Z"],["3800716","PFI-832015","PFI","daria.chekhunova@bolt-outsource.eu","Daria Chekhunova","!image-20260111-130256.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260111-130302.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T13:03:41.482Z"],["3800718","PFI-832016","PFI","tetiana.ivaniuk@bolt-outsource.eu","Tetiana Ivaniuk","[^Виписка по рахунку грудень 2025.pdf]\n\n[^Виписка по рахунку січень 2026.pdf]","2026-01-11T13:04:59.773Z"],["3800730","PFI-832028","PFI","akram.abubaker@bolt.eu","Akram Abubaker","!error.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T13:41:28.799Z"],["3800732","PFI-828855","PFI","duensip.sukarat@bolt-outsource.eu","Duensip Sukarat","Hi Team, Any update?","2026-01-11T13:57:11.334Z"],["3800735","HS-28715","HS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hi [~accountid:712020:968f9b18-e4cc-4bff-b0fd-f9b52cc452f0], we haven’t heard from you in a while. \n\nIf you’d like to keep this request open or have any additional information, please leave a comment, and we’ll get back to you as soon as possible.\n\nIf we don’t hear from you soon, we’ll proceed with closing the ticket, but feel free to reopen it anytime if needed.","2026-01-11T14:00:49.133Z"],["3800743","DO-5783","DO","pawel.kupidura@bolt.eu","Paweł Kupidura","[~accountid:62ea2a6a96eb272011a8098a] please validate this whole idea - I don’t know what is it that they can’t achieve with Databricks. We don’t have Looker & n8n integration, so we should direct them strongly to Databricks. Especially since we don’t want random people to get access to SQL runner.","2026-01-11T14:24:37.396Z"],["3800745","PFI-832043","PFI","antti.toivonen@bolt-outsource.eu","Antti Toivonen","!ScreenRecording_01-11-2026 13-06-21_1 (2).mp4|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T14:32:47.259Z"],["3800746","PFI-832044","PFI","antti.toivonen@bolt-outsource.eu","Antti Toivonen","!ScreenRecording_01-11-2026 13-06-21_1 (2).mp4|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T14:36:02.737Z"],["3800747","WFM-9930","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Agent’s profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/502609?tab=settings|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/502609?tab=settings]\n\nThe role needs a second approval, it is partially approved for now.","2026-01-11T14:40:03.484Z"],["3800753","WFM-9933","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Admin profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/562505?tab=queues|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/562505?tab=queues]\n\nAgent assigned to the queue. WFM, please update assembled if applicable.","2026-01-11T14:51:54.591Z"],["3800754","WFM-9934","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Hello [~accountid:712020:d68d8892-e046-430d-b677-2436ad1bdae7],\n\nCould you please share the agent’s Bolt email address? I couldn’t find anyone in our system with the ID number you shared. 🙏  \n\nWe found [agnes.mumbi@bolt-outsource.eu|mailto:agnes.mumbi@bolt-outsource.eu] - ID: 532255, please confirm if it is her.\n\nWe will be waiting for your reply to proceed with your request.","2026-01-11T14:55:32.086Z"],["3800762","WFM-9935","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Request posted on #delivery-disruption-comms channel on Slack and Adriana-Irina Iarca was also informed about the request in the comments: [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C090AK5GS5Q/p1768143524576059|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C090AK5GS5Q/p1768143524576059] ","2026-01-11T15:13:08.206Z"],["3800763","WFM-9935","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Hello [~accountid:63c675af9d59ec705fec3de1],\n\nPlease be informed that the proactive comms is now set up and it will be active until 12/01/2026 at 23:59 am EET.\n\nBest regards ","2026-01-11T15:15:50.755Z"],["3800764","SCM-1078","SCM","konstantin.karhu@bolt.eu","Konstantin Karhu","Monthly battery repair parts cost breakdown:\n[https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Qj7y2mJNTKLm1te3TrUna5jRdWM9MaK3boefeML2nL0/edit?gid=1618097096#gid=1618097096|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Qj7y2mJNTKLm1te3TrUna5jRdWM9MaK3boefeML2nL0/edit?gid=1618097096#gid=1618097096|smart-link] \nNeeds update by month, and separated by partner","2026-01-11T15:17:33.414Z"],["3800766","WFM-9936","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Agent’s profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/412399?tab=queues|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/412399?tab=queues]\n\nAgent removed from the queue, WFM, please update assembled if applicable.","2026-01-11T15:22:32.246Z"],["3800767","PFI-832061","PFI","jinjutha.wacherawuttikai@bolt-outsource.eu","Jinjutha Wacherawuttikai","!image-20260111-144956.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260111-145007.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T15:24:20.768Z"],["3800768","PFI-832064","PFI","jinjutha.wacherawuttikai@bolt-outsource.eu","Jinjutha Wacherawuttikai","!image-20260111-152726.png|thumbnail!\n\n!image-20260111-152741.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T15:28:32.590Z"],["3800771","PFI-832066","PFI","elijah.ojeamien@bolt-outsource.eu","Elijah Ojeamien","!image-20260111-153133.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T15:33:13.003Z"],["3800779","PFI-831432","PFI","marten.koger@bolt.eu","Marten Koger","Hi Bartosz,\n\nThank you for letting me know.\nI will be closing the ticket in that case without any further action from our side.\n\nBest,\nMarten","2026-01-11T16:57:47.862Z"],["3800782","PFI-823300","PFI","ireoluwa.obigbemi@bolt-outsource.eu","Ireoluwa Obigbemi","Hello Team, Any update","2026-01-11T17:09:25.998Z"],["3800797","PFI-832108","PFI","nela.megelova@bolt-outsource.eu","Nela Megelova","!IMG_2025 (2).png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T17:52:39.575Z"],["3800799","MARTECH3-1214","MARTECH3","anton.bugaev@bolt.eu","Anton Bugaev","Wrote some queries to AF/Singular/a bit of Mixpanel raw data.\n\nTried to understand how many users are actually returning/installing.\n\n(use this kind of query, but in Looker)\n\n*Matching AF/Singular (originally in [MARTECH-XXX] Random queries)*\n\n{noformat}SELECT count(sing_install), count_if(af_install is not null), count_if(mp_active is not null), count_if(af_install is not null or mp_active is not null) \nFROM \n(\nSELECT event_timestamp_date, UPPER(idfv) as sing_install\nFROM ng_singular_spark.attributions_v7\nWHERE platform = 'ios' and event_timestamp_date = '2026-01-05'-- between '2026-12-20' and '2026-01-10'\n) sing_installs\nLEFT JOIN\n(\nSELECT UPPER(idfv) as af_install\nFROM appsflyer.installs\nWHERE platform = 'ios' and event_date = '2026-01-05'and app_id in ('com.bolt.deliveryclient','id1451492388')\n) af_installs\non sing_installs.sing_install = af_installs.af_install\nLEFT JOIN\n(\nSELECT distinct(UPPER(device_id)) as mp_active\nFROM ng_mixpanel_food_eater_app.mp_ae_session\nWHERE mp_date = '2026-01-05' and mp_manufacturer = 'Apple'\n) mp\non sing_installs.sing_install = mp.mp_active{noformat}\n\nOut of 40k installs, AF and MixPanel only recognise one half (probably they just write not all possible events)\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.01.09.png|width=318,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.01.09.png\"!\n\nThe number of installs has stopped to converge to that of Appsflyer (when joined by user_id). \n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.09.19.png|width=588,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.09.19.png\"!\n\n\n\nWhen joined by date (checking installs overall):\n\n* iOS seems to decrease (and become comparable)\n* Android stagnates and stays the same.\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.36.48.png|width=217,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.36.48.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.37.40.png|width=207,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.37.40.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.38.49.png|width=202,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 20.38.49.png\"!\n\n\n\n* Checked that windows are similar\n** Google however has some probabilistic click-through and view-through\n** Meta has turned on AEM (which should be the case for AF also).\n*** But it looks like most conversions are deterministic.\n** !Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 21.02.29.png|width=353,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-11 at 21.02.29.png\"!\n","2026-01-11T17:58:16.817Z"],["3800818","DRX-27801","DRX","taxifyqa@bolt.eu","QA Testing","PR comment for QA:\nPlease check small and big screens, small and big values.","2026-01-11T18:53:00.928Z"],["3800820","PFI-832126","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-11T19:04:03.652Z"],["3800821","PFI-832127","PFI","sofia.tsiviniuk@bolt-outsource.eu","Sofia Tsiviniuk","!white_background_1920x1080.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T19:07:11.478Z"],["3800829","PFI-830927","PFI","charity.emeka@bolt-outsource.eu","Charity Emeka","Payment link\n\n[https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/partner-payments-payment/payments/72717166?filter={\"limit\"%3A25%2C\"offset\"%3A0%2C\"filter\"%3A{}}&tz=Africa%2FLagos|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/partner-payments-payment/payments/72717166?filter=%7B%22limit%22%3A25%2C%22offset%22%3A0%2C%22filter%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&tz=Africa%2FLagos]","2026-01-11T19:34:06.814Z"],["3800830","INT-470","INT","david.pirtskhalava@bolt.eu","David Pirtskhalava","26W02\n\n* A technical session-based experiment with the budget manager v2 and automated setup started this week in Warsaw. Monitoring did not reveal major bugs and everything is working as expected.\n* Work is on-going on introducing pricing context into the serve layer. We will then backtest pricing-aware model vs price-agnostic model. Working on a single metric to quantify performance gains simultaneously for all spend buckets.\n* Built the first version of model API (a notebook for producing forecasts for ad-hoc requests and performing deep-dives into model performance). Organized a short knowledge sharing session with product analytics team.  The API will be further developed in the coming weeks.","2026-01-11T19:37:45.833Z"],["3800833","WD-22533","WD","igne.martutaityte@bolt.eu","Ignė Martutaitytė","[^changes needed_2026.01.11 (49c86149-39b5-4e9c-b048-b4be085a0758).xlsx]","2026-01-11T20:18:16.834Z"],["3800840","FDBT-4778","FDBT","karl.ruudi@bolt.eu","Karl Ruudi","DAG commerce_finance_dimensions_modelling fails on 2026-01-11 12:00:00+00:00.\n\n        Exception:\n        Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 282, in _run_raw_task\n    TaskInstance._execute_task_with_callbacks(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3184, in _execute_task_with_callbacks\n    result = self._execute_task(context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 3208, in _execute_task\n    return _execute_task(self, context, task_orig)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 771, in _execute_task\n    result = _execute_callable(context=context, **execute_callable_kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/taskinstance.py\", line 742, in _execute_callable\n    return ExecutionCallableRunner(\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/utils/operator_helpers.py\", line 252, in run\n    return self.func(*args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/airflow/models/baseoperator.py\", line 424, in wrapper\n    return func(self, *args, **kwargs)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/bolt/airflow/operators/aws/ecr_docker_operator.py\", line 139, in execute\n    self.runtime_strategy.wait_until_done(self.container_id)\n  File \"/home/airflow/.local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/bolt/airflow/docker/batch/aws_batch_container_runtime_strategy.py\", line 215, in wait_until_done\n    raise AirflowException(f\"Batch job status is {current_job.status}, failing downstream task\")\nairflow.exceptions.AirflowException: Batch job status is FAILED, failing downstream task\n\n        Log URL: https://airflow-commerce.data.boltint.net/dags/commerce_finance_dimensions_modelling/grid?dag_run_id=scheduled__2026-01-11T12%3A00%3A00%2B00%3A00&task_id=custom_report_loading.commerce_finance_workday_finance_reports_custom_fx_rates&base_date=2026-01-11T12%3A00%3A00.000000%2B0000&tab=logs\n        ","2026-01-11T21:17:39.766Z"],["3800843","MARTECH3-1432","MARTECH3","sabrina.craffitasari@bolt.eu","Sabrina Lutfia Craffitasari","*Update Jan 12, 2025:*\n\n* Rerun the pre-analysis and based on the most recent data, number of inactive users in Poland has reduced by approximately 30%. The shrink caused unmet requirement of minimum sample size per variant. Possible alternative is to increase the MDE by 5% to 25% in order to have smaller sample size requirement.\n* Pre-analysis and its update is accessible here [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1eOZCu7sL-2oO6CQ_9zRw2T6s8KehaWeptBW7ml9uGDw/edit?gid=0#gid=0|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1eOZCu7sL-2oO6CQ_9zRw2T6s8KehaWeptBW7ml9uGDw/edit?gid=0#gid=0|smart-link] ","2026-01-11T21:42:12.090Z"],["3800845","MARTECH3-1228","MARTECH3","sabrina.craffitasari@bolt.eu","Sabrina Lutfia Craffitasari","*Update Jan 12, 2026:*\n\n* Enrollment is created [here|https://bolt-datascience.cloud.databricks.com/editor/notebooks/2487055656186260?o=3829506390716583#command/2487055656186277].\n* However based on the latest update, Poland has smaller targetable population, probably due to spike of reactivation over the holiday period. As a result, we do not have enough sample size. Other countries do not face this issue. This topic has been brought up as discussion here. Once decision is made regarding Poland, property will be sent to Braze and experiment can be launched ASAP.","2026-01-11T21:56:29.580Z"],["3800847","TAXP-790","TAXP","tiiu.albin@bolt.eu","Tiiu Albin","Hi [~accountid:712020:0b672045-ccee-47bd-a209-1bec8346b45c] [~accountid:62ea2a695111209f4fde8265] I wonder if there is any update on this yet? Many thanks! ","2026-01-11T22:28:53.963Z"],["3800848","INT-668","INT","alexander.tsyba@bolt.eu","Alexander Tsyba","[~accountid:63f5cbeb1223974bc04b700e] For reference: Option B from Figma should be implemented. \n\n[~accountid:5f23e70bb7a35e002a73ef5d] FYI","2026-01-11T22:34:19.007Z"],["3800852","PFI-832176","PFI","charity.emeka@bolt-outsource.eu","Charity Emeka","!image-20260111-224022.png|thumbnail!\n\n[^niyi.pdf]","2026-01-11T22:48:09.538Z"],["3800853","PFI-832176","PFI","charity.emeka@bolt-outsource.eu","Charity Emeka","[~accountid:6012ba2cd04785006861cac1] \n\n[~accountid:712020:7f456fc3-1ae4-4f6a-923a-a0a2d2ef5030] \n\n[~accountid:61efcdea57b25b006879a500] Kindly assist","2026-01-11T22:49:05.952Z"],["3800854","MARTECH3-1523","MARTECH3","wahyu.herlambang@bolt.eu","Wahyu Herlambang","Progress:\n\nBuilt confluence page of Bolt Business Knowledge Base: [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MP/pages/7381352464/WIP+Bolt+Business+Marketing+Knowledge+Base|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MP/pages/7381352464/WIP+Bolt+Business+Marketing+Knowledge+Base|smart-link] \n\nNext action item: waiting for review from the relevant teams.","2026-01-11T22:50:37.825Z"],["3800858","PFI-832180","PFI","zainab.sanni@bolt-outsource.eu","Zainab Sanni","!Screenshot_2026-01-12-00-15-12-808_com.whatsapp.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-11T23:17:14.894Z"],["3800859","PFI-832180","PFI","zainab.sanni@bolt-outsource.eu","Zainab Sanni","Hi team, please assist with payment matching","2026-01-11T23:17:40.284Z"],["3800860","MARTECH3-1419","MARTECH3","wahyu.herlambang@bolt.eu","Wahyu Herlambang","Waiting for answer from AMA team and AE team","2026-01-11T23:18:15.120Z"],["3800863","LSS-55768","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","*Final update:*\n\n# Business agreed to proceed with the latest suggestions by Multipsort on indemnity.\n# The document is to be signed via Docusign - latest updates are in the main ticket.\n\nClosing as this is resolved.","2026-01-11T23:44:00.220Z"],["3800871","WFM-9709","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","Current roles of the agent: \nBeehive Rides OPS Agent (ID: 66) • *CS - Safety (ID: 210186)* • Beehive CS Agent (ID: 63) • *CS - Rides - OPS Pilot (ID: 360158)* • *CS - Business (ID: 210171)* • *CS - Rides (ID: 210569)* • *CS - Rides - Car Block (ID: 300163)*\n\nMissing approval:\nCS - Micromobility (270168)\nRides - Fleet management (240158)","2026-01-12T00:37:25.247Z"],["3800872","WFM-9934","WFM","rodolfo.silva@bolt.eu","Rodolfo Bazante da Silva","If the agent Mohd meant is the one I made a comment, here’s her admin profile: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/532255?tab=queues|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/beehive/agents/edit/532255?tab=queues]","2026-01-12T00:42:19.084Z"],["3800877","PFI-829981","PFI","pakrampar.silrapasangchai@bolt.eu","Pakrampar Silrapasangchai","Hey [~accountid:712020:db5b1201-8d10-4d36-ba7f-c3ddac5e909e] ,\n\n