up of the current implementation in progress. Scoping of payment split functionality within the target architecture in progress.","2026-01-12T06:18:41.620Z"],["3801034","CRC-2218","CRC","michal.buzek@bolt.eu","Michal Buzek","[update]\n\n[Customer Payments]\n\nCustomer Payments engineer assigned to start with the tasks PC-4344 and PC-4345 on Monday, {{2026-01-12}}. ","2026-01-12T06:21:37.951Z"],["3801036","PFI-831795","PFI","yurii.hirak@bolt-outsource.eu","Yurii Hirak","Hello, Cashout is still pending, can you cancel that process?","2026-01-12T06:31:38.008Z"],["3801038","DSR-3451","DSR","martin.hosemann@bolt.eu","Martin Hosemann","Sending out message to the user that only entire deletion of the profile is possible","2026-01-12T06:36:26.482Z"],["3801041","DSR-3629","DSR","sigrid.hobejarv@bolt.eu","Sigrid Hõbejärv","First download failed, new started [here|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/billing-bulk-invoice-download/item/1380025/view]","2026-01-12T06:41:31.771Z"],["3801043","PFI-820503","PFI","martin.hosemann@bolt.eu","Martin Hosemann","Hi [~accountid:712020:fc661671-1d51-4372-9578-b46465bd51ac] , just a friendly nudge to see if the last message has reached you. Thanks!","2026-01-12T06:44:48.651Z"],["3801044","PFI-830473","PFI","ketlin.peldes@bolt.eu","Ketlin Peldes","Thanks! Reissued: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/billing-document/invoices?tz=Europe%2FTallinn&filter={\"limit\"%3A25%2C\"offset\"%3A0%2C\"filter\"%3A{\"created_from\"%3A1768168800%2C\"created_to\"%3A1768286611%2C\"to_agent_id\"%3A102511%2C\"to_agent_type\"%3A\"delivery_provider\"}}|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/billing-document/invoices?tz=Europe%2FTallinn&filter=%7B%22limit%22%3A25%2C%22offset%22%3A0%2C%22filter%22%3A%7B%22created_from%22%3A1768168800%2C%22created_to%22%3A1768286611%2C%22to_agent_id%22%3A102511%2C%22to_agent_type%22%3A%22delivery_provider%22%7D%7D]","2026-01-12T06:45:01.028Z"],["3801045","LSS-59913","LSS","alon.alkalay@bolt.eu","Alon Alkalay","Thanks [~accountid:712020:0c8dd65b-46d5-4dc0-b5bd-