Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-12T06:51:14.993Z"],["3801060","DRAG101-428","DRAG101","martin.petrov@bolt.eu","Martin Petrov","Goals:\n\n# Find a suitable glue to fix the D3 phone holder and bracket as an ad-hoc solution.\n## Any *sil-poxy* glue may work. [~accountid:60b9e4f58cf91900699878ec] \n## Any “super glue” may not bond with silicone material.\n# Discuss a long-term solution with the phone holder supplier to prevent the phone from rotating.\n## new silicon phone holder,\n## new clip.\n# Adjust the bracket for a tighter fit between the plastic clip and the silicone phone holder.\n## it requires mold modification. It`s priority to find a solution without mold re-work.","2026-01-12T06:52:41.793Z"],["3801061","INT-485","INT","priit.tiganik@bolt.eu","Priit Tiganik","26W2 Proposed a plan (summary [here|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/Ince/pages/7224885557/Cherry+Picker+revisit+2026-01]) to define true cherry pickers (supported by some analysis and suggestions, have a look from the doc), define city level dynamic profitability limit for defining Cherry Pickers, and updating the playbook","2026-01-12T06:52:53.545Z"],["3801064","PFI-829951","PFI","chargeback_reports@bolt.eu","chargeback_reports","გამარჯობა, \n\n  \n\nგთხოვთ უკუკავშირს.  \n\n   \n\nSincerely, \n\n________________________________________ \n\nთეკლე გოი/ Tekle goi \n\nCard Manager \n\nCustomer Support Department \n\nTel: +(995 32) 2 27 27 27 \n\n[{color:#0563C1}www.tbcbank.ge{color}|http://www.tbcbank.ge] \n\n  \n\n!image001.png|thumbnail!{color:#0093D3}{color}","2026-01-12T06:55:35.991Z"],["3801067","LSS-60845","LSS","johannes.varkki@bolt.eu","Johannes Gustav Varkki","There was no response. Closing the case.","2026-01-12T06:56:38.006Z"],["3801073","EBIKE1-376","EBIKE1","sander.viitak@bolt.eu","Sander Viitak"