1-12T13:17:20.992Z"],["3803644","L10N-27232","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.057Z"],["3803645","L10N-27218","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.046Z"],["3803646","L10N-27227","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.126Z"],["3803647","L10N-27220","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.148Z"],["3803648","L10N-27214","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.164Z"],["3803649","L10N-27217","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.159Z"],["3803650","L10N-27221","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.404Z"],["3803651","L10N-27219","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T13:17:21.473Z"],["3803652","DBRE-8688","DBRE","sangsun.bae@bolt.eu","Sangsun Bae","{noformat}mysql> USE `taxify_category_stats`;\nDatabase changed\nmysql> show create table _category_stats_old\\G\n*************************** 1. row ***************************\n       Table: _category_stats_old\nCreate Table: CREATE TABLE `_category_stats_old` (\n  `id` bigint(20) unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `created` timestamp NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  `last_update` timestamp NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  `activated` timestamp NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  `deactivated` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,\n  `driver_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `vehicle_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `source` enum('driver_state','driver_location','fleet_system','driver_dispatch_pref','category_config') NOT NULL,\n  `category_id` int(10) unsigned NOT NULL,\n  `category_group` varchar(45) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `category_group_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  KEY `driver_id_finished` (`driver_id`,`deactivated`),\n  KEY `activated_idx` (`activated`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=40273072838 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4\n1 row in set (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> RENAME TABLE `_category_stats_old` TO `_category_stats_old_del`;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.01 sec){noformat}","2026-01-12T13:17:22.011Z"],["3803653","L10N-27382","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27377](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27377)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-12T13:17:36.625Z"],["3803654","L10N-27385","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-27377](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-27377)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-12T13:17:37.783Z"],["3803655","L10N-27393","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this ta