t to Payments team: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/432\n- [Partner Payments] Driver/Fleet payout issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/312\n- [Customer Payments] Rider payment/charge issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/307\n\nTech Support\n- Driver/Fleet Campaign and Bonus issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/597\n- Driver app/backend/earning screen issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66\n- Rider app/backend issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/103\n- Wrong price calculation for the order: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/group/66/create/354\n\nFraud\n- Fraud related issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57/create/308\n\nBilling\n- Driver/Fleet Balance Disputes: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57\n- Driver/Fleet Invoicing and Reports Disputes:https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/57\n- Driver/Fleet/Rider Fiscalization (e.g. Missing QR, SAF-T) issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247\n- Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301\n\nCheers\nCommerce Team Jira Bot","2026-01-12T14:32:30.876Z"],["3804150","INT-317","INT","jina.park@bolt.eu","Jina Park","how far along are we on this? i guess we can delete as we’ll be creating tasks in Analytics Jira right? [~accountid:712020:9ffd93c0-be69-492c-af42-0a03b1e54cba] [~accountid:61027991627b560068c6ec21] ","2026-01-12T14:32:43.466Z"],["3804151","INT-318","INT","jina.park@bolt.eu","Jina Park","how far along are we on this? i guess we can delete as we’ll be creating tasks in Analytics Jira right? [~accountid:712020:9ffd93c0-be69-492c-af42-0a03b1e54cba] [~accountid:61027991627b560068c6ec21]","2026-01-12T14:32:55.131Z"],["3804153","BD-1976","BD","ave.tarend@bolt.eu","Ave Tarend","Negative balance -3.13 EUR is not transferred as there is also 0 BGN. This 0 BGN gets to this IF as there is {{>=}} not {{>}}:\n\n{noformat}        if (fromCourierBalance.balance >= 0) {\n            return `Only negative balances can be transferred. 'From courier' has positive ${balancePrefix}balance.`;\n        }{noformat}\n\n\n\nIn code there is no balance array or loop (for both EUR and BGN). Currency is taken from city preferences. So maybe city preferences for that activity has/had still BGN, not EUR.\n\n{noformat}const baseCityConfig = this.baseCityInMemoryData.getCityConfig(cityId);{noformat}","2026-01-12T14:32:57.711Z"],["3804154","L10N-26609","L10N","marina.santacreu@bolt.eu","Marina Santacreu","No strings displayed, so cancelling the ticket","2026-01-12T14:33:11.571Z"],["3804155","INT-577","INT","jina.park@bolt.eu","Jina Park","was this done or deprioritised and pending? [~accountid:712020:233144b7-8984-4e6b-922e-2ed0d6700d5f] ","2026-01-12T14:33:12.545Z"],["3804156","L10N-27204","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33:16.731Z"],["3804157","L10N-27205","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33:16.776Z"],["3804158","L10N-27211","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33:16.786Z"],["3804159","L10N-27199","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33:16.797Z"],["3804160","L10N-27197","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33:16.803Z"],["3804161","L10N-27196","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33:16.829Z"],["3804162","L10N-27201","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","This task was recently updated.","2026-01-12T14:33: