89","LSS-57150","LSS","kirsika.liiva@bolt.eu","Kirsika Liiva","SD: [https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/341976|https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/341976|smart-link] ","2026-01-13T08:11:58.309Z"],["3805392","PFI-832740","PFI","sandra.davidsson@bolt.eu","Sandra Davidsson","Hey again! 🙂 Please also check if you can allocate these payments automatically for business user, thanks! ","2026-01-13T08:12:07.522Z"],["3805395","WD-22556","WD","mirell.puusepp@bolt.eu","Mirell Puusepp","!Screenshot 2026-01-13 at 10.11.30.png|thumbnail!","2026-01-13T08:12:24.403Z"],["3805398","DO-5786","DO","rosemary.kinuthia@bolt.eu","Rosemary Kinuthia","I definitely selected the wrong workspace, thanks for noting this.","2026-01-13T08:12:36.791Z"],["3805407","CEBF-1621","CEBF","svitlana.vereshchagina@bolt.eu","Svitlana Vereshchagina","[~accountid:712020:7621878e-e68d-4cea-9df5-171c95c4c62d]  let’s merge changes and deploy together with AM Flow ","2026-01-13T08:13:30.604Z"],["3805409","DBRE-8688","DBRE","sangsun.bae@bolt.eu","Sangsun Bae","{noformat}+-----------------------+--------------------------------------------------------+------------+-----------+---------------------+---------------------+\n| TABLE_SCHEMA          | TABLE_NAME                                             | TABLE_ROWS | size in G | CREATE_TIME         | UPDATE_TIME         |\n+-----------------------+--------------------------------------------------------+------------+-----------+---------------------+---------------------+\n| taxify_admin          | _search_category_icon_check_result_ghc                 |          3 | 0G        | 2024-11-06 11:24:45 | NULL                |\n| taxify_admin          | _search_category_icon_check_result_gho                 |          0 | 0G        | 2024-11-06 11:24:45 | NULL                |\n| taxify_business       | _business_admin_user_20260109083030_del                |     780511 | 0G        | 2026-01-09 08:31:23 | 2026-01-09 08:29:46 |\n| taxify_business       | _business_app